<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Kutu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli Inogile ya Yesu Kilisito yandikigwe na Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mlk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbuli Inogile ya Yesu Kilisito yandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maluko</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Maluko ya mumkumbo wa vitabu vine va lagano da sambi, vitabu avo volagusa vija Yesu viyakalile hano mwiisi. Kila kitabu acho chokemigwa, “Injili,” fambulo jake Mbuli Inogile. Vitabu avo vandikigwa ako kumwande na Matayo na Maluko na Luka na Yohana kipindi Yesu viyafile na kuzilibuka. Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Maluko acho kitabu kiguhi mna ivitabu vine va Mbuli Inogile. Vivija chogesigwa kamba acho kitabu cha ichanduso kwandikigwa mna ivitabu vose va Mbuli Inogile. Yogesigwa chandikigwa mwaka 65-70 toka kuvumbuka kwa Kilisito. Wanhu wengi woifunza vinhu wogesa kamba chandikigwa Lumi kwa kilamuso cha kuwagela moyo wanhu wamtogole Yesu ako.</para>
  <para style="ip">Vivija Maluko kokemigwa Yohana Maluko, kakala miyao na mtumigwa Paulo na Balinaba, lakini mbuli ziyalongigwe vihile mbuli yake hazoneke kipindi viyawalekile muumwanza wa kimishieni. (Sang'h 13:13). Abaho Maluko kanga kabili na Balinaba (Sang'h 15:37-39). Vivija Maluko kajuwika kamba kakala uki na kidole na Petulo (1 Pet 5:13). Hamoja Maluko hazone kwa meso mbuli za Yesu viyakalile mwiisi, wanhu woifunza vinhu wogesa kamba Maluko kandika mbuli nyingi ziyaone Petulo na azo mbuli zimemile mna Imbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Maluko. Mna Imbuli Inogile, Maluko kalonga ng'hani mbuli za uwanahina na mafundizo ga Yesu mna ikipindi cha kimambukizo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zili mkitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Maluko kosonga ikitabu mna isula ya 1:1-13.</para>
  <para style="io">Abaho Maluko kosimulila sang'hano ya Yesu viyakalile ako Galilaya (Sula ya 1:14-8:21).</para>
  <para style="io">Abaho kolonga mbuli ya mwanza wa Yesu ako Yelusalemu (Sula ya 8:22-10:52).</para>
  <para style="io">Maluko komambukiza kwa kwandika mbuli ya kipindi cha Yesu ako Yelusalemu, na komambukiza na ifa yake na kuzilibuka (Sula ya 11:1-16:8).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatizaji kowapetela wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 3:1-12; Luk 3:1-18; Yoh 1:19-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ino ayo Mbuli Inogile ya Yesu Kilisito Mkombola, Mwana wa Mulungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Isonga kamba viyandikigwe na mtula ndagu wa Mulungu Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mulungu kalonga, ‘Nomtuma msenga wangu yakulongolele</para>
  <para style="q">yaitande nzila yako.’</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Munhu imoja kokema kuluwala,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Itandeni nzila ya Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q">goloseni nzila yake yonda yabite!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yohana Mbatizaji kalawilila kuluwala kawapetela wanhu, “Lekeni nzambi na mbatizigwe na Mulungu kozigela kumgongo nzambi zenu.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wanhu wengi kulawa mwiisi ya Yudea na kudibuga da Yelusalemu wachola kumtegeleza Yohana. Watogola kamba wana nzambi, Yohana kawabatiza muulwanda lwa Yolidani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yohana kavala kiwalo kitendigwa kwa mibahila ya ngamiya na mkwiji wa ng'hwembe mkigudi chake, lujo lwake lukala nzige na uki. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kawapetela wanhu, “Munhu yonda yeze kukisogo changu ni munhu mkulu kunibanza nene. Niye sifaya hata kudohola nzabi za vilatu vake. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Niye nowabatiza kwa mazi, lakini heyo kowabatiza kwa Loho Yang'alile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kubatizigwa na kugezigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 3:13-4:11; Luk 3:21-22; 4:1-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mna ikipindi acho Yesu kalawa mna ikijiji cha Nazaleti mwiisi ya Galilaya na Yohana kambatiza muulwanda lwa Yolidani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu viyalawile mgamazi, bahaja kawona ulanga ugubuka na kamona Loho Yang'alile kohumuluka kamba huwa na kakala uchanha yake. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Sauti ihulikigwa kulawa kuulanga ilonga, “Gweye kwa Mwanangu nikunogele. Ninogelwa na gweye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Bahaja Loho Yang'alile kamulongoza yachole kuluwala, <verse number="13" style="v"/>kakala kuko kuluwala siku malongo mane, kagezigwa na Mwenembago. Wanyama wa kumuhulo wakala aho lakini wasenga wa kuulanga weza wamsang'hanila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema wavuwa somba wane</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 4:12-22; Luk 4:14-15; 5:1-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yohana viyagodekigwe mkifungo, Yesu kachola isi ya Galilaya, kawapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile ya Mulungu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kalonga, “Kipindi kivika, Undewa wa Mulungu wammabehi! Lekeni nzambi na muitogole Mbuli Inogile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile kobita kumgwazo wa lamba da Galilaya kawavika wavuwa somba wabili, Simoni na mdodo wake Andeleya wakala wovuwa somba na mizavu yao.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="07 Fishing.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="1:16">Munhu kovuwa somba kwa lwavu</figure> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nikwelelezeni, na niye nowatenda muwe wavuwaji wa wanhu.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bahaja waileka mizavu yao, wamkweleleza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kagenda kumwande, kawavika wandugu wabili wayagwe. Yakobo na Yohana, wanage Zebedayo. Wakala mwiingalawa woitanda mizavu yao. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bahaja Yesu viyawone kawakema, nao wamuleka tatao Zebedayo na wasang'hanaji zake mwiingalawa, wamkweleleza Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Munhu yeli na kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Luk 4:31-37</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wavika kudibuga da Kapelinaumu, viivikile siku ya Kubwihila Yesu kengila mng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu, kasonga kufundiza. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wanhu wamuhulike wakanganya mafundizo gake, kwavija hafundize kamba wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, ila kafundiza kwa udahi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Abaho munhu yakalile na kinyamkela kengila mng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu, kaguta, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Vino, kolonda choni kumwetu, gweye Yesu wa Nazaleti? Kwiza kutukoma? Nokujuwa gweye kwa ija Yang'alile yatumigwe na Mulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kamkomhokela ikinyamkela, “Nyamala! Mulawe munhu ino!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kinyamkela kamgela kisango munhu ayo, kaguta nyangi, kamulawa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wakanganya ng'hani, avo wasonga kuilongela, “Vino kino choni? Mafundizo gano ga sambi! Munhu ino kana udahi wa kulava vinyamkela, nao womtegeleza!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Avo mbuli za Yesu zibwililika himahima kila hanhu mwiisi ya Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanhu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 8:14-17; Luk 4:38-41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu na wanahina zake, hamoja na Yakobo na Yohana walawa mna ing'anda ya kumpula Mulungu, wachola kuna ikae ya Simoni na Andeleya. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mkwe wa kitwanzi wa Simoni kakala yawasile mulusazi kolumwa homa, Yesu viyavikile wamulongela mbuli za mtamu ayo. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kamgendela mtwanzi ayo, kamgoga mkono kamwinula. Homa imulawa na kasonga kuwasang'hanila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ichungulo, zuwa vidihongile, wanhu wamgalila Yesu watamu na waja wakalile na vinyamkela. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wa kudibuga dija waiting'hana haluhelengo lwa ing'anda. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kawahonya wanhu wengi wakalile na mitamu na kawalava vinyamkela wengi. Hawalekile vinyamkela walonge kwavija wamjuwa kakala nani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapetela wanhu ako Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">Luk 4:42-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Imitootondo ng'hani siku diyagwe, Yesu kalamuka kasegela, kachola kunze kudibuga, hanhu kuduhu wanhu, kuko kampula Mulungu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Simoni na wayage wachola kumzahila, <verse number="37" style="v"/>viwamvikile wamulongela, “Kila munhu kokuzahila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Tolondeka kuchola kuna ivijiji viyagwe vili behi. Ako nako nolondeka kuwapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile, kwavija acho kiminzile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kachola kila hanhu mwiisi ya Galilaya, kawapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile mzing'anda za kumpula Mulungu na kulava vinyamkela.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 8:1-4; Luk 5:12-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Munhu imoja yeli na utamu wa dikulu kamgendela Yesu, kamfugamila, kampula, kalonga, “Wahalonda kodaha kunihonya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kamonela bazi, kamgolosela mkono, kamkwasa, kalonga, “Nolonda, hona!” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Bahaja utamu umulawa, kahona. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela yachole, kamzuma, <verse number="44" style="v"/>kamulongela, “Tegeleza, sekeumulongele munhu yoyose mbuli ino, lakini goga inzila mbaka kwa mulava nhosa, yakakulolese lolese. Abaho kalave nhosa kamba viyalagize Musa ili kutenda kila munhu yatogole kamba kuhonyigwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Lakini munhu ayo kasegela, kasonga kuzibwililisa mbuli azo kila hanhu, kalonga mbuli nyingi mbaka Yesu hadahile kwingila mwiisi kunze kunze. Avo Yesu kakala kunze hanhu kuduhu wanhu, lakini wanhu wamcholela kulawa kila hanhu.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu yaholole</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 9:1-8; Luk 5:17-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hazibitile siku nyingi, Yesu kabwela Kapelinaumu, mbuli zibwililika kwa wanhu kamba kakala ukae. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wanhu wengi waiting'hana hamoja mbaka kukala kuduhu gati disigale, wamema mbaka kuluhelengo. Yesu kakala kowapetela mbuli. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Abaho weza wanhu wane, wampapile munhu yaholole walonda kumgala kwa Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwavija kukala na lunhu, hawadahile bule kumgala kwa Yesu. Avo watobola zonzo kukiswili uchanha ya aho haakalile Yesu, wahumulusa mkeka muyatambalale munhu ayo yaholole. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu viyakone kutamanila kwao, kamulongela munhu ayo yaholole, “Mwanangu, nzambi zako zigeligwa kumgongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe wakalile hanhu aho wagesa mna imizoyo yao, <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Munhu ino kodahaze kulonga vino? Ino komkudula Mulungu! Mulungu yaiyeka ayo yodaha kuzigela kumgongo nzambi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bahaja Yesu kakijuwa kiwagesile mna imizoyo yao. Avo kawauza, “Habali mogesa avo? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vino choni kibuhile, kumulongela munhu yaholole, ‘Nzambi zako zigeligwa kumgongo’, hebu kulonga, ‘Ima, papa mkeka wako utembele?’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lakini nolonda mujuwe, Mwana wa Munhu kana udahi mwiisi wa kuzigela kumgongo nzambi za wanhu.” Avo kamulongela munhu ayo yaholole, <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Nokulongela, lamuka, papa mkeka wako, uchole ukae!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nayo kenuka, kapapa mkeka wake, kalawa kunze na kasegela mgameso gao. Wose wakanganya, wamtogola Mulungu na walonga, “Hatunachona kinhu kamba kino!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komkema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 9:9-13; Luk 5:27-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kabweleganya kabili kumgwazo wa lamba da Galilaya. Lunhu lwa wanhu lumcholela, nayo kasonga kuwafundiza. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Viyakalile kobita, kamvika mbokela kodi imoja twaga jake Lawi, mwanage Alufayo kakala mng'anda ya kulipila kodi. Yesu kamulongela, “Nikweleleze.” Lawi kenuka, kamkweleleza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile koja mng'anda ya Lawi, wabokela kodi wengi na wanhu wene nzambi, wakala hamoja nayo woja na wanahina zake, kwavija wanhu wengi wakala womkweleleza. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe wakalile Mafalisayo viwamonile Yesu koja na wanhu wene nzambi na wabokela kodi, wawauza wanahina zake, “Habali koja na wanhu kamba wano?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu viyahulike avo kawedika, “Wanhu wagima hawamulonda mganga, ila wanhu watamu womulonda. Sizile kuwakema wanhu wogesa wanoga, niza kuwakema wanhu wene nzambi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kufunga kuja</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 9:14-17; Luk 5:33-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wanahina wa Yohana Mbatizaji na wanahina wa Mafalisayo wakala wofunga kuja. Wanhu wayagwe wamcholela Yesu, wamuuza, “Habali wanahina wa Yohana na wanahina wa Mafalisayo wofunga kuja lakini wanahina zako hawafunga kuja?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vino yodahika vilihi wanhu wagonekigwe kuna dizengele wafunge kuja kipindi munhu yosola kahamoja nao? Bule! Hawadaha kufunga kuja. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini kipindi chokwiza munhu yosola vonda yasegezigwe kumwao, baho wofunga kuja.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Kuduhu munhu yokwika kilaka cha kiwalo cha sambi mna kiwalo cha umwaka. Yahatenda avo, kilaka cha sambi chokidega kiwalo cha umwaka, na aho hadegeke hokongezeka. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vivija kuduhu munhu yogida divai ya sambi mna mifuko ya ng'hwembe ya umwaka, kwavija yahatenda avo divai ya sambi yoitula imifuko na divai yokwitika na imifuko yobanangika. Ila divai ya sambi yogidigwa mna imifuko ya ng'hwembe ya sambi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya siku ya Kubwihila</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 12:1-8; Luk 6:1-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Siku dimoja da Kubwihila, Yesu na wanahina zake wakala wobita mna imigunda ya uhemba. Viwakalile wobita, wanahina zake wasonga kuhulula uhemba. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mafalisayo wamulongela Yesu, “Lola, wanahina zako wotenda kinhu kigomesigwe kutendigwa kudi siku da Kubwihila!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Hamusomile kija kiyatendile Daudi kipindi heyo na wayage viwakalile na nzala? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mna ikipindi cha Mkulu wa walava nhosa Abiatali, Daudi kengila mna Ing'anda ya Mulungu na kugaja magate galavigwe nhosa kwa Mulungu. Magate gago golondigwa kudigwa na walava nhosa waiyeka, lakini Daudi kagaja na abaho kawagwaa wayage.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela, “Siku ya Kubwihila ikigwa mbuli ya wanhu, na siyo wanhu mbuli ya siku ya Kubwihila. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Avo Mwana wa Munhu ayo Mndewa wa siku ya Kubwihila.”</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Munhu yeli na mkono uholole</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 12:9-14; Luk 6:6-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kachola kabili mng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu. Ako kukala na munhu yakalile na mkono uholole. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe wakalile aho walonda kilamuso cha kumtagusila Yesu, avo wamulola bunhuu kamba komuhonya munhu ayo mna isiku ya Kubwihila. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela munhu ayo yaholole mkono, “Ima hano kuulongozi.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawauza wanhu awo, “Vino Malagizo getu gotulonda tutende choni mna isiku ya Kubwihila? Kutenda ganogile hebu kutenda gehile? Kuuhonya ugima wa munhu hebu kuukoma?”</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini wao wanyamala huupi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu kawalola wanhu awo kwa kugevuzika, kawonela bazi mbuli ya udala wa mizoyo yao. Abaho kamulongela munhu ayo, “Golosa mkono wako.” Nayo kaugolosa mkono wake, na mkono wake uhona. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Abaho Mafalisayo walawa kunze mna ing'anda ya kumpula Mulungu, waiting'hana na wanhu wa Helode, wakala kiseto wamkome Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Lunhu lomkweleleza Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wachola kudilamba da Galilaya, lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu lumkweleleza. Walawa kuzi isi za Galilaya na Yudea, <verse number="8" style="v"/>na buga da Yelusalemu, na isi ya Idumeya, na umwambu wa Yolidani, na kulawa mzimbaka zili mmabehi na mabuga ga Tilo na Sidoni. Wanhu wose awo wamcholela Yesu kwavija wahulika mbuli zake ziyakalile kotenda. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwavija lunhu lukala lukulu, Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake wamtandile ngalawa muladi wanhu sekewamsung'he sung'he. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwavija Yesu kawahonya wanhu wengi, avo wanhu wose wakalile watamu wakala woisung'ha sung'ha wadahe kumkwasa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Wanhu wakalile na vinyamkela viwamonile Yesu, wamgwila kuulongozi waguta mizangi wolonga, “Gweye kwa Mwana wa Mulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kawagomesa vinyamkela sekewamulongele munhu yoyose kamba heyo kakala nani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosagula watumigwa longo na wabili</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 10:1-4; Luk 6:12-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kakwela kukigongo, kawakema wanhu yawalondile mwenyego, nao wamgendela. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kawasagula wanhu longo na wabili, kawakema watumigwa. Kawalongela, “Niwasagula mweye mukale na niye. Vivija nowagala mkawapetele wanhu Mbuli Inogile, <verse number="15" style="v"/>na mweye mokuwa na udahi wa kulava vinyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wano awo longo na wabili iyawasagule, wakala Simoni, Yesu kamgwaa twaga da Petulo <verse number="17" style="v"/>na Yakobo na ndugu yake Yohana, wanage Zebedayo kawagwaa twaga da Boanilige, fambulo jake, “Wana wa Ng'huwa” <verse number="18" style="v"/>na Andeleya na Filipo na Batulumayo na Matayo na Tomaso na Yakobo mwana wa Alufayo na Tadayo na Simoni Mkananayo, <verse number="19" style="v"/>na Yuda Isikaliote, yamuhinduke Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 12:22-32; Luk 11:14-23; 12:10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kachola ukae. Lunhu lwa wanhu luiting'hana kabili mbaka Yesu na wanahina zake walemelwa kuja. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ndugu zake viwahulike avo, wagenda kumsola kwavija wanhu wakala wolonga, “Kana kibozi mbwelela!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe walawile Yelusalemu wakala wolonga, “Kana Belizebuli! Ayo mkulu wa vinyamkela yomgwaa udahi wa kuwalava vinyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kawakema na kawalongela kwa simo, “Vino Mwenembago kodahaze kumulava Mwenembago? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kamba undewa wahaigola wenyego na kuitowa, undewa awo wogwa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Wanhu wa lubuga lumoja wahaigola na kuitowa, lubuga lulo logwa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Avo kamba undewa wa Mwenembago wahaigola wenyego, undewa awo wogwa na kuhelela baho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Kuduhu munhu yodaha kutula ng'anda ya munhu mwene nguvu na kusola vinhu vake, mbaka yasonge kumgodeka munhu ayo, baho kodaha kusola vinhu vake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Nowalongela ukweli, nzambi zose ziwatendile wanhu na maligo gao gose, Mulungu kodaha kugela kumgongo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lakini munhu yoyose yomuliga Loho Yang'alile, maligo gake hondagageligwe kumgongo bule, kwavija katenda nzambi ya mazuwa gose.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga avo kwavija wanhu wakala wolonga, “Kana kinyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mamake na ndugu zake Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 12:46-50; Luk 8:19-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Abaho mamake na ndugu zake Yesu weza, wema kunze wamtuma munhu yamkeme Yesu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu lukala lumzunguluke Yesu. Nao wamulongela, “Go mkulu, mamako na ndugu zako wa kunze, wokulonda gweye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mamangu ayo nani? Na ndugu zangu wao nani?” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Baho kawalola wanhu awo wamzunguluke, kawalongela, “Loleni! Wano awo mamangu na ndugu zangu! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Munhu yoyose yotenda gaja golondigwa na Mulungu, ayo ndugu yangu na lumbu jangu na mamangu.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa munhu yohanda</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 13:1-9; Luk 8:4-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kasonga kufundiza kabili kumgwazo wa lamba da Galilaya. Lunhu lwa wanhu lumzunguluka mbaka kengila mwiingalawa na kukala mumo. Wanhu wose wakala kumgwazo wa lamba. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kawafundiza vinhu vingi kwa simo, kawalongela,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Tegelezeni! Kukala na munhu kachola kuhanda mbeyu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Viyakalile komiza zimbeyu kumgunda, ziyagwe zilagalila mnzila, ndege weza na kuzija. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ziyagwe zilagalila mgamabwe hakalile na udongo mdodo. Zota himahima kwavija udongo ukala mdodo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Zuwa vidilawile, diisoma mimeya na kwavija mizizi yake haicholile hasi ng'hani, inyala. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila mvisolo va miba, visolo avo vikula na kuizonga mimeya, nayo ilemelwa kulela. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lakini mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila hanhu heli na udongo unogile. Zota, zikula na kulela kubanza zija zihandigwe, ziyagwe zilela malongo madatu, ziyagwe zilela malongo sita, na ziyagwe zilela gana dimoja.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kalonga, “Munhu yeli na magwiti, yahulike!”</para>
  <para style="s">Kilamuso cha kulonga kwa simo</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 13:10-17; Luk 8:9-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile yaiyeka, wanahina zake longo na wabili na wanhu wayagwe wamulongela yawafambulile simo azo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye mugweleligwa kuzijuwa mbuli zifisigwe za Undewa wa Mulungu, lakini awo weli kunze wohulika mbuli zose kwa simo, <verse number="12" style="v"/>muladi,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Walole, lakini sekewone,</para>
  <para style="q">wategeleze lakini sekewajuwe.</para>
  <para style="q">Kwavija wahavijuwa, wodaha kumbwelela Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q">na Mulungu kozigela kumgongo nzambi zao.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofambula lusimo lwa munhu yohanda</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 13:18-23; Luk 8:11-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawauza, “Hamulujuwile vilihi lusimo luno? Vino lelo molujuwaze lusimo lolose luyagwe? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Muhandaji kohanda mbuli ya Mulungu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe waigala na izimbeyu zilagalile mnzila, wahahulika mbuli, Mwenembago kokwiza na kuisola mbuli ihandigwe mgati mmwao. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe waigala na mbeyu zilagalile mna gamabwe. Wahahulika mbuli, bahaja wozibokela kwa kudeng'helela, <verse number="17" style="v"/>lakini kwavija waduhu mizizi mgati mmwao, wokala kipindi kidodo. Wahagaya na kudununzika mbuli ya usenga awo, wobwela kukisogo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe waigala na mbeyu zilagalile mna ivisolo va miba. Wohulika mbuli, <verse number="19" style="v"/>lakini magayo ga ugima uno, kulonda utajili, na kulonda mbuli nyingi ziyagwe kuizonga mbuli ayo, nayo ilemelwa kulela. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini wanhu wayagwe waigala na mbeyu zilagalile muudongo unogile. Wouhulika usenga, woutogola na wolela matunda, wayagwe malongo madatu wayagwe malongo sita na wayagwe gana dimoja.”</para>
  <para style="s">Taa igubikigwe</para>
  <para style="r">Luk 8:16-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Vino munhu kodaha kubwinha taa mng'anda na kuigubika na kikalango hebu kuika muuvungu wa lusazi? Vino haika kukingolobweda? <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwavija kinhu chochose kifisigwe chokoneka na kinhu chochose kigubikigwe chogubuligwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yeli na magwiti yahulike!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vivija kawalongela, “Iteganyeni na gaja gomuhulika! Vija vimuwatagusa wayagwe na Mulungu kowatagusa vivo na mokongezeligwa ng'hani. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Waja weli na vinhu wokongezelwa, lakini waja waliduhu vinhu wobokigwa hata vija vidodo viwelinavo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mbeyu ikula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Undewa wa Mulungu uigala na kija kilawilile kwa munhu yamizile mbeyu mumgunda wake. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ikilo kowasa, imisi kolamuka, mbeyu zota na kukula, lakini heyo hajuwa choni kigendelela. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Udongo wenyego wozitenda mbeyu zikule goya na kulela matunda, tanhu majani, abaho mada, na womambukiza kwa kuzamiza. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Uhemba wahakangala, munhu ayo kosola sengo na kosonga kusenga kwavija kipindi cha kusenga kivika.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="12 Sickle.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="4:29">Munhu kosenga kwa sengo</figure></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mbeyu ndodo ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 13:31-32, 34; Luk 13:18-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga kabili, “Vino Undewa wa Mulungu uigala na choni? Vino tuusimulile kwa lusimo gani? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Uigala na kija kilawilile kwa munhu yasolile mbeyu ya haladali mbeyu ndodo kubanza zose na kuihanda mumgunda. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lakini yahahandigwa, yokula na yokuwa mbiki mkulu kubanza mibiki yose ihandigwe mumgunda. Yokwika matambi makulu ng'hani mbaka ndege wozenga mvulu zao mna gamatambi gake.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kawapetela wanhu usenga wake kwa simo nyingi ziigalile na zino, kawalongela mbuli nyingi kamba viwadahile kuzijuwa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Halongile nao kinhu chochose bila simo, lakini viwakalile waiyeka na wanahina zake, kawafambulila vinhu vose.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohoza beho kulu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 8:23-27; Luk 8:22-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ichungulo ya siku dijo, Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Tuloke mwambu wa lamba.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Avo wawaleka wanhu wose, wanahina zake wengila mwiingalawa yaakalile Yesu na wachola nayo. Vivija kukala na ngalawa ziyagwe hanhu aho. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Bahaja dilawilila nyukwanyukwa kulu da beho na ng'humbi mgamazi gaizola ija ingalawa mbaka ilonda kumema mazi.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="4:37">Ngalawa yozoligwa na ng'humbi</figure> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu kakala kukisogo mwiingalawa, kawasa na keka pala jake muna umto. Wanahina zake wamulamusa na kumulongela, “Mfundiza! Vino gweye hutonga, tweye tofa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kalamuka, kadikomhokela dija dibeho, “Nyamala!” Baho beho dinyamala tuluu, na kukala poozi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Habali modumba? Mung'hali mduhu kutamanila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Wanahina zake wadumba na waiuza wenyego, “Vino ino munhu gani? Mbaka beho na ng'humbi vose vomuhulika!”</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu yeli na vinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 8:28-34; Luk 8:26-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu na wanahina zake waloka mbaka mwambu wa lamba da Galilaya, mwiisi ya Wagelasi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Baho Yesu viyalawile mwiingalawa, kaiting'hana na munhu yeli na vinyamkela. Munhu ayo kalawa kuna gamapanga. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Munhu ayo kakala yokala kuna gamapanga gago, kuduhu munhu yadahile kumgodeka minyololo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Miyanza mingi wageza kumgodeka minyololo mmakono na mmagulu, lakini kakala yozikanha na kuzibena bena mhingu zili mmagulu gake. Kakala na nguvu ng'hani na kuduhu munhu yadahile kumgoga. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Imisi na ikilo kakala yokwanga mna gamapanga gaja na kuna ivigongo, kaguta nyangi na kuikanha kanha kwa mabwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Viyamone Yesu kwa kutali, kamkimbilila na kamfugamila. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kaguta, “Yesu, Mwana wa Mulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani! Kolonda choni kumwangu? Iduile kwa twaga da Mulungu kamba hunidununza bule!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kalonga avo kwavija Yesu kamulongela, “Kinyamkela, mulawe munhu ino!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kamuuza, “Twaga jako nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Munhu ayo kamwidika, “Twaga jangu Lunhu, kwavija twa wengi!” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kampula Yesu sekeyawagale ivinyamkela kunze ya isi ija.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kukala na bumbila kulu da nguluwe wakala woja kuna umtelemuko wa kigongo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Avo vinyamkela wampula Yesu, “Tugale kwa nguluwe, na utuleke tuwengile wao.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kawatogolela, avo vinyamkela wamulawa munhu ayo, na wengila mna iwanguluwe. Bumbila jose da nguluwe elufu mbili wahumulukila kudilamba, wose wafila mumo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wanhu wakalile wowasusila nguluwe awo wakimbila na kuzibwililisa mbuli azo mwiisi na kumigunda. Abaho wanhu wachola kulola kija kilawilile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Viwavikile kwa Yesu, wamona munhu ayo yakalile na vinyamkela kakala aho na kavala goya viwalo, na nzewele zake zimbwelela na wanhu wose wadumba. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wanhu wachone acho kilawilile, wawalongela wayao gaja gampatile munhu ayo yakalile na vinyamkela, na mbuli za nguluwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Avo wanhu wampula Yesu yasegele mwiisi yao.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile kokwela mwiingalawa, munhu ayo yakalile na vinyamkela kampula Yesu wachole wose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamulemela, kamulongela, “Bwela ukayako ukawalongele wanhu wa lukolo lwako gaja gose Mndewa gayakutendele, na viyakonele bazi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Avo munhu ayo kasegela, kachola hanhu hakemigwe Dekapoli, kawalongela wanhu gaja gose Yesu gayamtendele. Wanhu wose wahulike wakanganya.</para>
  <para style="s">Mndele wa Yailo na mtwanzi yakwasile kiwalo cha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 9:18-26; Luk 8:40-56</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kabwela mwambu uyagwe wa lamba. Lunhu lwa wanhu lumzunguluka kumgwazo wa lamba. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Abaho keza mkulu imoja wa ng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu, twaga jake Yailo. Viyamone Yesu, kaibwanha hasi mmagulu gake, <verse number="23" style="v"/>kampula ng'hani, “Mndele wangu kolumwa ng'hani. Nokupula chonde chonde, wize ukamwikile makono muladi yahone na yawe mgima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kachola na Yailo, lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu lumkweleleza kuno lomsung'ha sung'ha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Baho kukala na mtwanzi yakalile na utamu wa kutumika kwa miyaka longo na mibili. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mtwanzi ayo kachola kwa waganga wengi na katumia vinhu vose viyakalile navo, lakini hahonile bule, ila kagendelela kulumwa ng'hani. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Viyazihulike mbuli za Yesu, kengila mna ulunhu lwa wanhu, kamcholela Yesu kukisogo na kakwasa kiwalo chake. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kailongela mwenyego, “Nahakwasa kiwalo chake, nohona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Viyakwasile kiwalo cha Yesu, bahaja kutumika kuleka, nayo kahulika kahona utamu wake. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bahaja Yesu kajuwa nguvu zimulawa, avo kahinduka muulunhu na kuuza, “Nani yanikwasile kiwalo changu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Wanahina zake wamwidika, “Kowona wanhu viwokusung'ha sung'ha, abaho kouza nani yakukwasile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kalola mhande zose ili yamone munhu yatendile vivo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mtwanzi ayo kajuwa kinhu kimulawilile, avo kamgendela Yesu kuno kodumba na kugwaya. Kamfugamila Yesu, kamulongela fulu ipile. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela mtwanzi ayo, “Mwanangu, kutamanila kwako kukuhonya. Genda moyo uholile, kuhona utamu wako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile kogendelela kulonga, wasenga kulawa ukayake Yailo weza na kumulongela Yailo, “Mndele wako kafa. Habali kogendelela kumgaza Mfundiza?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu viyazihulike mbuli azo zilongigwe na wasenga awo, hazigesile bule, lakini kamulongela Yailo, “Sekeudumbe, togola tu.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu halondile munhu yoyose iyagwe yamkweleleze, ila Petulo, Yakobo na Yohana, ndugu yake Yakobo. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Viwavikile mng'anda ya Yailo, Yesu kawona wanhu wobwahanhuka kwa usungu na kuiyalala. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kengila mng'anda kawalongela, “Habali moiyalala na kulila? Imwana hafile bule, lakini kawasa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lakini wamseka, avo Yesu kawalava kunze wose, kamsola tatake na mamake ija imwana, na waja wanahina zake wadatu. Wengila mna idigati mulutambalizwe lukuli lwa mwana ayo. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kamgoga mkono, kamulongela, “Talita Kumi!” fambulo jake, “Mndele, nokulongela lamuka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Bahaja mndele ayo kenuka na kasonga kugenda. Mndele ayo kakala na miyaka longo na mibili. Mbuli ino viilawilile, wanhu wakanganya ng'hani. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kawagomesa ng'hani sekewamulongele munhu yoyose mbuli ayo ilawilile, abaho kawalongela, “Mgweleleni lujo mndele ino.”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemigwa ako Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 13:53-58; Luk 4:16-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kasegela hanhu aho kachola kudibuga diyavumbuke, na wanahina zake wamkweleleza. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vidivikile siku da Kubwihila, Yesu kasonga kufundiza mng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu. Wanhu wamuhulike wakanganya ng'hani, waiuza, “Munhu ino kazipata kwahi mbuli zino? Nzewele gani ino mbaka kodaha kutenda unzonza uno? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vino ino siyo ija fundi selemala, mwanage Malia, na ndugu zake Yakobo na Yusufu na Yuda na Simoni? Vino lumbu zake hawakala bahano bule?” Avo wamulema.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mtula ndagu kotegelezigwa kila hanhu, lakini hategelezigwa ukayake na kwa ndugu zake, na kwa wanhu wa lukolo lwake mwenyego.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu hatendile unzonza wowose, ila kawekila makono watamu kidogo na kawahonya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kakanganya ng'hani kwavija wanhu wakala waduhu kutamanila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatuma wanahina longo na wabili</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 10:5-15; Luk 9:1-6</para>
  <para style="p">Abaho Yesu kachola mna ivijiji vili behi, na kasonga kuwafundiza wanhu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kawakema wanahina longo na wabili, kawatuma wabili wabili, na kawagwaa udahi wa kulava vinyamkela. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Sekemusole kinhu chochose, ila mkongoja wiiyeka. Sekemusole gate hebu mkoba hebu sente mkibindo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Valeni vilatu, lakini sekemusole kiwalo kiyagwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hanhu hohose honda mubokeligwe, kaleni aho mbaka vonda musegele. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mwahavika kudibuga jojose na wanhu wa aho wahalema kuwabokela hebu kuwategeleza, segeleni na kung'huseni matimbwisi geli mmagulu genu muladi iwe kilaguso kamba wawatendela nzambi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Avo wasegela na kuwapetela wanhu waleke nzambi zao. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wawalava vinyamkela wengi na kuwabakaza mavuta wanhu wengi wakalile watamu na kuwahonya.</para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Yohana Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 14:1-12; Luk 9:7-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mndewa Helode kahulika mbuli azo zose, kwavija twaga da Yesu dikala dijuwike kila hanhu. Wanhu wayagwe wakala wolonga, “Yohana Mbatizaji kazilibuka kulawa kwa wafile, lekaavo kana udahi wa kutenda unzonza.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe walonga, “Ino Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Na wanhu wayagwe walonga, “Ino mtula ndagu kaigala na imoja wa watula ndagu wa Mulungu wa kuko umwaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Helode viyazihulike mbuli azo, kalonga, “Ino ayo Yohana Mbatizaji inimkanhile pala jake lakini kazilibuka kulawa kwa wafile!” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Helode mwenyego kakala yalagize Yohana yagodekigwe nzabi, abaho yekigwe mkifungo. Katenda avo mbuli ya Helodiya iyamsolile, hamoja kakala mwehe wa Filipo, mdodo wake. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yohana Mbatizaji kakala yomulongela Helode, “Malagizo golonga, havinogile bule gweye umsole mwehe wa mdodo wako!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Avo Helodiya kakala komwihila Yohana, na kalonda kumkoma. Lakini hadahile bule, <verse number="20" style="v"/>kwavija Helode kakala komdumba Yohana na kajuwa kamba kakala munhu yanogile na yang'alile avo kamkaliza. Kakala konogelwa kumuhulika, hamoja moyo umuluma ng'hani kila viyamalile kumuhulika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Siku dimoja, Helodiya kapata nyafasi mna idisiku da kukumbuka kuvumbuka kwa Helode. Helode kawatendela nyimwili nyimwili ng'hulu wakulu wa mabuga, na wakulu wa wakalizi, na walangulizi wa isi ya Galilaya. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mndele wa Helodiya viyengile kuvina, kamnogeza ng'hani Helode na wageni wagonekigwe kuna inyimwili nyimwili. Avo mndewa Helode kamulongela mndele ayo, “Nipule chochose kiulonda, nokugwaa.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kaiduila, “Noiduila, nokugwaa chochose chondaunipule, hata nusu ya undewa wangu nokugwaa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Avo mndele ayo kalawa kunze kamuuza mamake, “Nipule choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nayo kamwidika, “Pula pala da Yohana Mbatizaji.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Bahaja mndele ayo kakimbila mbaka kwa mndewa, kamulongela, “Sambi baha nigwelele pala da Yohana Mbatizaji mditanda!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mndewa kona usungu ng'hani, lakini kwavija kaiduila mgameso ga wanhu wagonekigwe, hadahile kumulemela. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Bahaja mndewa kamulagiza mkalizi yadigale pala da Yohana. Mkalizi kagenda mkifungo, kakanha pala da Yohana. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Abaho kadika pala dija mditanda, kamgalila mndele ayo, nayo kamgwaa mamake. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wanahina wa Yohana viwahulike mbuli ayo, wachola kulusola lukuli lwa Yohana na kuluzika.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowagwaa lujo lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 14:13-21; Luk 9:10-17; Yoh 6:1-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Watumigwa wabwela, waiting'hana na Yesu na wamulongela gaja gose gawatendile na kufundiza. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Baho kukala na wanhu wengi wakalile wokwiza na kusegela, mbaka Yesu na wanahina zake hawapatile nyafasi ya kuja kinhu. Avo Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Tucholeni twiiyeka hanhu kuduhu wanhu mkabwihile kidogo.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Avo wasegela waiyeka mwiingalawa, wachola hanhu kuduhu wanhu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wanhu viwonile wosegela, bahaja wawajuwa. Avo walawa mna gamabuga gose, wakimbila mbaka wawalongolela kuvika Yesu na wanahina zake. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu viyahumuluke mwiingalawa, kaluvika lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu. Kawonela bazi kwavija wakala kamba ng'hondolo weliduhu msusilaji. Avo kasonga kuwafundiza vinhu vingi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Zuwa vidikalile dohonga, wanahina zake wamcholela Yesu, wamulongela, “Hanhu hano hatwili kuduhu wanhu, na sambi zuwa dohonga. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Walongele wanhu wachole mna imigunda na vijiji vilibehi muladi wakaigulile vinhu va kuja.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Wagweleleni mweye kinhu cha kuja waje.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamuuza, “Vino tuchole tukagule magate ga sente ifaya kumulipa msang'hanaji kwa miezi minane<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="fk">Sente za miezi minane,</char> hebu sente magana mabili.</note>tuwagwee waje?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu kawauza, “Munago magate mangapi? Gendeni mukalole.”</para>
  <para style="p">Viwagalolile, wamulongela, “Kuna magate matano na somba wabili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake wawagole wanhu wose mna ivibumbila bumbila, wakale hasi mna gamajani mabisi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Avo wakala mna ivibumbila va wanhu gana na va wanhu malongo matano. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kasola gaja gamagate matano na somba wabili, kalola uchanha na kamgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu. Abaho kagabanzula gaja gamagate, kawagwaa wanahina zake wawagolele wanhu. Vivija kawagolela wose somba waja wabili. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Wanhu wose waja na kwiguta. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Abaho wanahina zake wadondola magate gasigale na iwasomba, wamemeza vigelo longo na vibili. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Wambigalo waiyeka wadile wakala gana elufu tano.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotembela uchanha mgamazi</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 14:22-33; Yoh 6:15-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Bahaja Yesu kawalagiza wanahina zake wakwele mwiingalawa wamulongolele kuchola Betisaida, kuna umwambu uyagwe wa lamba. Heyo kakala yolulaga lunhu lwa wanhu lusegele. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Viyamambukize kuwalaga wanhu, kakwela kuna ikigongo kumpula Mulungu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Viivikile ichungulo, ngalawa ikala hagati ya lamba, lakini Yesu kakala yaiyeka mwiisi inyalile. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu kawona wanahina zake wolemelwa kutowa ng'hafi, kwavija beho kulu dikala dowabweza kuwalawile. Nzogolo zikwika, Yesu kawagendela, kuno kotembela uchanha mgamazi. Kalonda kuwabita, <verse number="49" style="v"/>lakini viwamone kotembela uchanha mgamazi, wagizaga mzimu. Wakemelela kwa bwembwe. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Wose viwamone wadumba ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="p">Bahaja Yesu kawalongela, “Gangamaleni! Iyo nene! Sekemudumbe!” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kengila mwiingalawa, na beho dinyamala tuluu. Wanahina zake wakanganya ng'hani, <verse number="52" style="v"/>kwavija wakala hawajuwile fambulo da kuwagwaa lujo wanhu elufu tano, mizoyo yao ikala midala.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya watamu ako Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 14:34-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Waloka umwambu, wavika kuna iisi ya Genesaleti, baho waifunga ngalawa yao. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Bahaja viwahumuluke mwiingalawa, wanhu wamjuwa Yesu. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Avo wakimbila mwiisi yose, na kila hanhu viwahulike Yesu kabaho wamgalila watamu watambalale mvisazi vao. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Kila hanhu Yesu hayacholile, iwe mna ivijiji, hebu mna gamabuga, hebu mna imigunda, wanhu wawasola watamu zao na kuwagala kuna gamagulilo. Wampula Yesu yawatogolele waikwase mhindo ya kiwalo chake. Wose waikwasile wahona.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mafundizo ga wahenga</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 15:1-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe wezile kulawa Yelusalemu waiting'hana haulongozi wa Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wawona wanahina wayagwe wa Yesu woja bila kusunha makono gao kamba viilondeka wanhu watende.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mafalisayo na Wayahudi wayagwe wokweleleza mafundizo gawabokele kwa wahenga zao, hawaja kinhu mbaka wasunhe makono gao ng'hani. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wala hawaja kinhu chochose kulawa kudigulilo mbaka wasunhe, na wokweleleza mafundizo gayagwe mengi kamba vija mwiko wa kusunha vikasi na nongo na viya va shaba na gayagwe mengi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Avo Mafalisayo na Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wamuuza Yesu, “Habali wanahina zako hawakweleleza mafundizo gatugoleligwe na wahenga zetu, lakini woja bila kusunha makono?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mweye mwa wanafiki! Kumbe mtula ndagu wa Mulungu Isaya kalagula goya mbuli zenu viyandike,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mulungu kolonga, wanhu wano, wonitegeleza kwa milomo yao,</para>
  <para style="q">lakini mizoyo yao yakutali ng'hani na niye.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Awo wonitambikila bule,</para>
  <para style="q">kwavija wofundiza mafundizo ga wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q">na kugatenda kamba galawa kwa Mulungu!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Mweye mogaleka Malagizo ga Mulungu na mogagoga mafundizo ga wanhu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Mweye mwa wabala kwa kulema Malagizo ga Mulungu na kugagoga mafundizo genu wenyego. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwavija Musa kawalagiza, ‘Mtegeleze tatako na mamako,’ ‘Munhu yoyose yonda yamulige tatake hebu mamake kolondeka yakomigwe.’ <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lakini mweye mofundiza, kamba munhu kana kinhu kodaha kumtaza tatake hebu mamake lakini kolonga ‘Ino kobani’ fambulo jake kinhu kino nimulavila Mulungu, <verse number="12" style="v"/>munhu ayo halondeka kumtaza tatake hebu mamake. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kwa nzila ino mafundizo genu gomuwagwaa wanhu gosegeza mbuli za Mulungu. Na gayagwe mengi kamba gano gomutenda.”</para>
  <para style="s">Vinhu vimgela munhu dikwe</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 15:10-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kalukema lunhu lwa wanhu kabili na kalulongela, “Mweye mose mnitegeleze na mujuwe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kuduhu kinhu kingila mmulomo wa munhu kulawa kunze kidaha kumgela munhu dikwe. Lakini, kija kilawa mmulomo wa munhu acho kimgela munhu dikwe.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Munhu yeli na magwiti yahulike.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu na wanahina zake, viwalulekile lunhu lwa wanhu na kwingila mng'anda, wanahina zake wamuuza yawalongele fambulo da ulonzi uja. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Vino mweye mduhu nzewele kubanza wanhu wayagwe? Vino hamujuwile kamba kuduhu kinhu kingila mmulomo wa munhu kulawa kunze kidaha kumgela munhu dikwe? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwavija hakingila muumoyo lakini mna iinda na abaho cholawa kunze ya lukuli.” Kwa ulonzi uno Yesu kavitenda vinhu vose va kuja vinoge kudigwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kagendelela kulonga, “Kinhu kilawa muumoyo wa munhu acho kimgela munhu dikwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwavija muumoyo wa munhu molawa magesa gehile na kuiwasa chaka chaka na ubavi na ukomaji, <verse number="22" style="v"/>na ugoni na umelo na gehile na uvizi na kusulukila na migongo na maligo na kuitapa na ubozi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ago gose gehile golawa mgati mwa munhu na kumgela munhu dikwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kutamanila kwa mtwanzi imoja</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 15:21-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kahalawa hanhu aho kachola mwiimbaka ili behi na buga da Tilo. Kengila mng'anda na halondile munhu yoyose yajuwe kakala aho, lakini hadahile bule kuifisa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mtwanzi imoja, yakalile na mndele wake yeli na kinyamkela, viyahulike mbuli za Yesu, bahaja kamgendela na kamfugamila Yesu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mtwanzi ayo hakalile Muyahudi, kavumbuka kudibuga da Silofoinike mwiisi ya Siliya kampula Yesu yamulave mndele wake kinyamkela. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamwidika, “Tanhu waleke wana wegute. Kwavija havinogile bule kusola lujo lwa iwana na kuwapigisila umbwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mtwanzi ayo kamwidika, “Ona, go mkulu, lakini hata umbwa weli hasi mmeza woja kija kisigazigwe na iwana!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela mtwanzi ayo, “Kwavija kwidika vivo, bwela ukayako na komvika mndele wako kinyamkela kamulawa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mtwanzi ayo kachola ukayake, viyavikile kamvika mndele wake katambalala mulusazi na kinyamkela kakala yamulawile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu hadahile kulonga na kuhulika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kasegela kachola behi na isi ya Tilo kwa kubitila mwiisi ya Sidoni mbaka kudilamba da Galilaya kwa kubitila nzila ya mna zimbaka za Dekapoli. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe wamgalila munhu yakalile hahulika na halonga, wampula Yesu yamwikile makono. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kamsola kamgala hamgwazo hanhu kuduhu wanhu. Yesu kengiza vidole mna gamagwitwi ga munhu ayo, katema mate kamkwasa lulimi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kalola kuulanga, kabweza mhumuzi, kamulongela, “Efata!” fambulo jake, “Vuguka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bahaja munhu ayo magwiti gake gavuguka na kakala yohulika na kulonga bila kugaya. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawagomesa wanhu awo sekewamulongele munhu yoyose mbuli ayo, lakini Yesu viyagendelele kuwagomesa, vivo viwagendelele kuibwililisa mbuli ayo. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wanhu wose waihulike mbuli ayo wakanganya. Walonga, “Katenda goya kila kinhu, kowatenda wanhu hawahulika wahulike na wanhu hawalonga walonge!”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowagwaa lujo elufu nne</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 15:32-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hazibitile siku nyingi lunhu luyagwe lukulu lwa wanhu luiting'hana. Wanhu viwakalile waduhu kinhu chochose cha kuja Yesu kawakema wanahina zake kawalongela, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Niye nowonela bazi wanhu wano, kwavija wakala na niye kwa siku ndatu na waduhu kinhu cha kuja. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nahawalongela wabwele ukayao na nzala, wosinduka mnzila, kwavija wanhu wayagwe walawa kutali.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wanahina zake wamuuza, “Hano hatwili twa kuluwala, tolupata kwahi lujo lwa kuwagwaa wanhu wose wano?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu kawauza, “Mna magate mangapi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Tuna magate saba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kalulongela lunhu luja lwa wanhu lukale hasi. Abaho kasola gamagate saba, kamgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu, kagabanzula kawagwaa wanahina zake wawagolele wanhu, na wanahina zake watenda vivo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vivija wakala na visomba kidodo. Yesu kamgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu, vivija kawalongela wanahina zake wawagolele wanhu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wanhu waja na kwiguta. Abaho wanahina zake wadondola vija visigale na kumemeza vigelo saba. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wambigalo waiyeka wadile wakala elufu nne. Abaho Yesu kawalaga, <verse number="10" style="v"/>bahaja Yesu na wanahina zake wakwela mwiingalawa, wachola mwiisi ya Dalimanuta.</para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wolonda vilaguso</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 12:38-42; 16:1-4</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe wamcholela Yesu wasonga kuibamilila nayo, walonda kumgeza wampula yatende kilaguso kulawa kuulanga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kona usungu, kalonga, “Habali wanhu wa lukolo luno lwa sambi molonda vilaguso? Nowalongeleni ukweli, kuduhu kilaguso chonda mugoleligwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kawaleka, kakwela mwiingalawa kaloka mwambu uyagwe wa dilamba.</para>
  <para style="s">Usasu wa Mafalisayo na Helode</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 16:5-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wanahina zake wakala waisemwile kusola magate, wakala na gate dimoja diiyeka mwiingalawa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu kawazuma wanahina zake kawalongela, “Muiteganye na usasu wa Mafalisayo na usasu wa Helode.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wanahina zake wasonga kuinyong'onyela, “Ino kolonga vino kwavija twaduhu magate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kakijuwa kiwakalile wolonga, kawauza, “Habali moilongela mbuli ya magate? Vino mung'hali hamujuwile? Habali mizoyo yenu midala? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Muna meso lakini hamulola, muna magwiti lakini hamuhulika? Vino hamukumbuka bule? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vinibanzule magate matano na kuwagwaa wanhu elufu tano? Vino mmemeza vigelo vingapi kwa avo visigale?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Tumemeza vigelo longo na vibili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kawauza kabili, “Vivija vinibanzule gaja magate saba na kuwagwaa wanhu elufu nne, vino mmemeza vigelo vingapi kwa avo visigale?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Tumemeza vigelo saba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Abaho kawauza, “Mung'hali hamnavijuwa?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya msuwameso ako Betisaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu na wanahina zake viwavikile Betisaida, wanhu wayagwe wamgalila Yesu munhu yakalile msuwameso, wampula yamkwase. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kamgoga mkono munhu ayo, kamulava kunze ya kijiji kija. Abaho kamtemela mate mgameso, kamwikila makono, kamuuza, “Vino kokona choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Munhu ija kalola, kalonga, “Nowona wanhu, lakini waigala na mibiki itembela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kamwikila makono kabili mgameso. Munhu ayo kabunhula meso na meso gake galola, nayo kadaha kulola goya vinhu vose. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela munhu ayo yachole ukayake, kamzuma, “Sekeyabweleganye mna ikijiji.”</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kolonga Yesu ayo Mkombola</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 16:13-20; Luk 9:18-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu na wanahina zake wachola kuna ivijiji va Kaisalia ya Filipi, mnzila Yesu kawauza wanahina zake, “Nongeleni wanhu wolonga niye na nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Wanhu wayagwe wolonga gweye kwa Yohana Mbatizaji, wanhu wayagwe wolonga gweye kwa Eliya, kuno wayagwe wolonga gweye kwa imoja wa watula ndagu wa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kawauza, “Na mweye molonga niye na nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo kamwidika, “Gweye kwa Kilisito Mkombola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawagomesa wanahina zake, “Sekemumulongele munhu yoyose mbuli zangu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli ya madununzo na ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 16:21-28; Luk 9:22-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kasonga kuwafundiza wanahina zake, “Mwana wa Munhu kolondeka yadununzigwe ng'hani na kulemigwa na wavele na wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa. Kokomigwa na siku da kadatu kozilibuka.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela fulu ipile, avo Petulo kamgala Yesu kumgwazo kasonga kumkomhokela. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kahinduka kawalola wanahina zake, kamkomhokela Petulo, “Segela kumwangu Mwenembago! Kwavija hugesa mbuli za Mulungu lakini kogesa mbuli za kiunhu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kalukema lunhu lwa wanhu na wanahina zake kawalongela, “Munhu yoyose yahalonda kunikweleleza, yaileme mwenyego na kuidikwa msalaba wake yanikweleleze. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yahalonda kuukombola ugima wake kowagiza, na munhu yoyose yowagiza ugima wake mbuli ya niye na kwa Mbuli Inogile koukombola. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Vino munhu kopata choni kamba yahaipata isi yose na kuwagiza ugima wake? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kuduhu kinhu chonda yalave yaubweze ugima wake. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Munhu yoyose yonyonela kinyala niye na mafundizo gangu mna ulukolo lwa sambi lulekile kumjuwa Mulungu na kutenda gehile, Mwana wa Munhu nayo komonela kinyala munhu ayo yaheza muukulu wa Tatake na wasenga zake wang'alile wa kuulanga.”</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Nowalongela ukweli, wanhu wayagwe weli hano hawafa bule mbaka wawone Undewa wa Mulungu ukwiza na nguvu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaluka</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 17:1-13; Luk 9:28-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vizibitile siku sita, Yesu kamsola Petulo, Yakobo na Yohana, kachola nao waiyeka kuna ulugongo lutali. Viwakalile wolola, Yesu kagaluka. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Viwalo vake vikala vizelu chuwee, na kuduhu munhu yoyose mwiisi yodaha kuvifuwa viwe vizelu kamba vivo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Baho wanahina waja wadatu wamona Eliya na Musa wolonga na Yesu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Petulo kamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, vinoga tweye tukale hano! Tozenga viheha vidatu, kimoja chako gweye, kimoja cha Musa na kimoja cha Eliya.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Petulo hajuwile cha kulonga kwavija heyo na wayage wakala wodumba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Abaho dilawilila wingu na kuwagubika na sauti ilawa mdiwingu, ilonga, “Ino ayo Mwanangu inimnogele. Mumtegeleze!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bahaja wawegesela kuno na kuno, lakini hawamonile munhu yoyose iyagwe, ila Yesu yaiyeka hamoja nao.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Viwakalile wohumuluka kulugongo Yesu kawazuma, “Sekemumulongele munhu yoyose mbuli zino zimone, mbaka Mwana wa Munhu vonda yazilibuke kulawa kwa wafile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Watogola kija kiwalongeligwe, lakini wasonga kuiuza, “Kuzilibuka kwa wafile, fambulo jake choni?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Wanahina zake wamuuza Yesu, “Habali wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wolonga Eliya kolondeka yeze tanhu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Ona, Eliya kokwiza tanhu, muladi yakitande goya kila kinhu. Lakini habali Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, Mwana wa Munhu kodununzika ng'hani na kulemigwa? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nowalongeleni, Eliya kamala kwiza na wanhu wamtendela viwalondile, kamba vija Maandiko Gang'alile vigalonga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya mbwanga yeli na kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 17:14-21; Luk 9:37-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Viwawavikile waja wanahina wayagwe, waluwona lunhu lwa wanhu luwazunguluka na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe wakala woibamilila nao. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bahaja wanhu viwamone Yesu wakanganya ng'hani, wamkimbilila, wamulamusa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kawauza wanahina zake, “Mweye moibamilila nao choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Munhu imoja mna ulunhu lwa wanhu kamwidika, “Mfundiza, nikugalila mwanangu, kana kinyamkela yamfungile mulomo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kinyamkela ayo yahamwizila, komulagaza hasi na kolawa miholovu mumulomo, kodafuna meno na kunyala lukuli lose. Niwalongela wanahina zako wamulave ikinyamkela, lakini hawadahile bule.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye wanhu muleka kutamanila! Ng'hale na mweye mbaka lini? Nogela kitumbe kumgongo mbaka lini? Ngalileni hano imbwanga.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Avo wamgala kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Bahaja kinyamkela viyamone Yesu, kamgela kisango imbwanga ayo, kagwa hasi, kaibimbilisa, kuno kolava mihovu mumulomo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kamuuza tata wa imbwanga ayo, “Utamu uno umsonga lini?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kamwidika, “Umsonga toka haudodo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Miyanza mingi kinyamkela kamgeza kumkoma kwa kumbwanha muumoto na mgamazi. Tonele bazi na ututaze, kamba wahadaha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Kolonga, kamba wahadaha! Kila kinhu chodahika kwa munhu yotamanila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bahaja tata wa imbwanga ija kakemelela, “Notamanila, lakini kutamanila kwangu kudodo. Nhaze nitamanile ng'hani!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu viyaluwone lunhu lowamemela, kamkomhokela kinyamkela ayo, “Gweye kinyamkela wa kuleka kulonga na kuhulika, nokulagiza umulawe mbwanga ino, sekeumwingile kabili!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kinyamkela kaguta, kambwanha hasi mbwanga ayo, kamulawa. Mbwanga ayo koneka kamba munhu yafile, kila munhu kalonga, “Kafa!” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamgoga mkono mbwanga ayo kamtaza kwinuka, nayo kenuka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu viyengile mng'anda, wanahina zake wamuuza kinyelegezi, “Habali tweye hatudahile kumulava kinyamkela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Kinyamkela kamba ino hadahika kulavigwa kwa nzila yoyose, ila kwa kumpula Mulungu kwiiyeka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga kabili mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 17:22-23; Luk 9:43-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wasegela hanhu aho wachola kubitila isi ya Galilaya. Yesu halondile munhu yoyose yajuwe kuyeli, <verse number="31" style="v"/>kwavija kakala kowafundiza wanahina zake. Kawalongela, “Mwana wa Munhu kogeligwa mmakono ga wanhu, nao womkoma na siku da kadatu kozilibuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lakini wanahina zake hawadijuwile fambulo da ulonzi awo na wadumba kumuuza.</para>
  <para style="s">Yeli mkulu nani?</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 18:1-5; Luk 9:46-48</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wavika Kapelinaumu, viwengile mng'anda, Yesu kawauza wanahina zake, “Mukala muibamilila choni mnzila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lakini wanahina zake hawamwidike bule, kwavija mnzila wakala woibamilila nani yeli munhu mkulu viweli. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu kakala hasi, kawakema wanahina zake longo na wabili, kawalongela, “Munhu yoyose yolonda kuwa wa ichanduso, kolondeka yawe wa ikimambukizo na yawe msang'hanaji wa wose.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kamsola mwana mdodo kamwimiza haulongozi wao, kamuhagatila kawalongela, <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Munhu yoyose yombokela mwana mdodo kamba ino kwa twaga jangu, kombokela niye, na munhu yoyose yombokela niye hambokela niye niiyeka vivija kombokela ija yanhumile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Munhu yoyose hatulema kaubanzi wetu</para>
  <para style="r">Luk 9:49-50</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yohana kamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, tumona munhu imoja kolava vinyamkela kwa twaga jako. Tweye tumgomesa kwavija siyo miyetu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Sekemumgomese, kwavija kuduhu munhu yotenda unzonza kwa twaga jangu na kuno kononga vihile. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose hatulema kaubanzi wetu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nowalongela ukweli munhu yoyose yowagwaa kikasi cha mazi ga kung'wa kwa twaga jangu kwavija mweye mwa wanhu wa Kilisito kobokela nhunza yake.</para>
  <para style="s">Kugezigwa kutenda nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 18:6-9; Luk 17:1-2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Munhu yoyose yomuhonza imoja wa wadodo wano wonitogola yatende nzambi, yokuwa vinoga munhu ayo yagodekigwe dibwe kulu da kudugila msingo na yasigwe mbahali. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kamba mkono wako wahakuhonza utende nzambi, ukanhe! Yokuwa vinoga wingile kuna ugima na mkono umoja, kubanza wingile na makono mabili na abaho uchole jehanamu kuna umoto haufaga. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mumo, ‘Funza wowaja hawafa bule na umoto uwalukuza haufaga.’ <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kamba mgulu wako wahakuhonza utende nzambi, ukanhe! Yokuwa vinoga wingile kuna ugima na mgulu umoja, kubanza wingile na magulu gose mabili na abaho wasigwe jehanamu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mumo, ‘Funza wowaja hawafa bule na umoto uwalukuza haufaga.’ <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kamba siso jako dahakuhonza utende nzambi, ding'ole! Yokuwa vinoga wingile Muundewa wa Mulungu na siso dimoja, kubanza wingile na meso gose mabili na abaho wasigwe jehanamu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Mumo, ‘Funza wowaja hawafa bule na umoto uwalukuza haufaga.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Kila munhu kotendigwa yatogoligwe na Mulungu kwa moto kamba vija nhosa viitogoligwa na Mulungu kwa mkele.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>“Mkele unoga, lakini kamba wahagiza ukali wake, vino kodahaze kuubweza kabili?</para>
  <para style="p">“Muwe na mkele mgati yenu na mukale kwa tindiwalo na waenu.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofundiza mbuli ya nyasa</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 19:1-12; Luk 16:18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kasegela kachola isi ya Yudea, kaloka lwanda lwa Yolidani, lunhu lwa wanhu lumcholela Yesu kabili, nayo kawafundiza kamba viyatendaga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe wamcholela Yesu wamgeza, wamuuza, “Tulongele, vino vinoga mbigalo kumwasa mwehe wake?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kawauza, “Vino Musa kawalagiza choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Musa katulagiza kamba mbigalo kodaha kumgwaa kibua cha nyasa mwehe wake na kumwasa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Musa kawandikila lagizo dino mbuli ya udala wa mizoyo yenu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Maandiko Gang'alile golonga kulawa kuna ichanduso, ‘Mulungu kawaumba mbigalo na mtwanzi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kwa mbuli ayo mbigalo komuleka tatake na mamake na koilumba na mwehe wake, <verse number="8" style="v"/>na wabili awo wokuwa kinhu kimoja.’ Avo haweli wabili kabili, lakini kinhu kimoja. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Avo kiyalumbilize Mulungu, munhu sekeyakigole.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Viwabwelile mng'anda, wanahina zake wamuuza Yesu mbuli ino. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mbigalo yomwasa mwehe wake na kumsola mtwanzi iyagwe, komtendela ugoni mwehe wake. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vivija mtwanzi yomulema mkasano wake na kusoligwa na mbigalo iyagwe kotenda ugoni.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatambikila wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 19:13-15; Luk 18:15-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe wamgalila Yesu wana wadodo yawahagatile na kuwatambikila, lakini wanahina zake wawakomhokela. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu viyonile avo, kagevuzika, kawalongela, “Walekeni wana wadodo weze kumwangu sekemuwagomese kwavija Undewa wa Mulungu ni wa wanhu kamba wana wano. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli, munhu yoyose yolema kuubokela Undewa wa Mulungu kamba mwana mdodo, honda yengile ng'o.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Abaho kawahagatila wana waja kawekila makono gake kawatambikila.</para>
  <para style="s">Munhu tajili</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 19:16-30; Luk 18:18-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu viyasongile mwanza wake kabili, munhu imoja kamkimbilila, kamfugamila kamuuza, “Mfundiza Unogile, nhende choni niupate ugima wa mazuwa gose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kamuuza, “Habali kong'hema unogile? Kuduhu yanogile, ila Mulungu yaiyeka. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kugajuwa Malagizo ga Musa, ‘Sekeukome, sekeutende ugoni, sekewibe, sekeulave usindila wa uvizi, sekeulonge uvizi, wategeleze tatako na mamako.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Munhu ayo kamwidika, “Mfundiza gano gose nigagoga toka haudodo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kamulola bunhuu, kamnogela, kamulongela, “Kuhungukilwa kinhu kimoja. Genda kachuuze vinhu vose viulinavo na uwagwelele wakiwa zisente na gweye kokuwa na utajili kuulanga. Abaho unikweleleze.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Munhu ija viyahulike avo, kona usungu, kasegela kuno kanyunyuwala kwavija kakala tajili ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kalola mhande zose kawalongela wanahina zake, “Yokuwa vidala ng'hani kwa munhu tajili kwingila Muundewa wa Mulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ulonzi uno uwasinhusa wanahina zake, lakini Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Wanangu, vidala ng'hani kwingila Muundewa wa Mulungu! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vibuha kwa ngamiya kubita mna ikizonzo cha sanzia kubanza tajili kwingila Muundewa wa Mulungu.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="14 Camel.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="10:25">Ngamiya</figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wanahina wakanganya ng'hani waiuza, “Avo lelo nani yonda yadahe kukomboligwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu kawalola bunhuu, kawalongela, “Kwa munhu haidahika lakini kwa Mulungu haili vivo, gose godahika kwa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Petulo kamulongela, “Lola, tweye tuleka kila kinhu na tukukweleleza gweye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongela kweli, munhu yoyose yalekile ng'anda yake hebu ndugu zake hebu lumbu zake hebu mamake hebu tatake hebu wanage hebu migunda mbuli ya niye na kwa Mbuli Inogile, <verse number="30" style="v"/>kobokela vingi ng'hani mna ikipindi cha sambi. Na kobokela ng'hani miyanza gana, ng'anda na ndugu na lumbu na wana na mama na migunda na hamoja na madununzo na mna ikipindi chondakize kobokela ugima wa mazuwa gose. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lakini wanhu wengi weli wa ichanduso wokuwa wa ikimambukizo na waja wa ikimambukizo wokuwa wa ichanduso.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mwanza wa kadatu mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 20:17-19; Luk 18:31-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wakala mnzila wochola Yelusalemu. Yesu kawalongolela wanahina zake wakalile wokanganya kuno wanhu wakalile womkweleleza wadumba. Yesu kainega hamgwazo na wanahina zake longo na wabili, kawalongela gaja gonda gamulawilile. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Tegelezeni, tochola Yelusalemu, kuko Mwana wa Munhu kogeligwa mmakono ga wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa. Womtagusa yafe na kogeligwa mmakono ga wanhu haweli Wayahudi, <verse number="34" style="v"/>nao womzeha na womtemela mate na womtowa mbalati na womkoma lakini siku da kadatu kozilibuka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kupula kwa Yakobo na Yohana</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 20:20-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Abaho Yakobo na Yohana, wana wa Zebedayo wamcholela Yesu, wamulongela, “Mfundiza, kuna kinhu tolonda ututendele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu kawauza, “Molonda niwatendele choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Vondaukale kuna ikigoda chako cha Undewa wako, tolonda ukale na tweye, imoja mwambu wa mkono wako wa kudila na iyagwe mwambu wa mkono wako wa kumoso.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Hamkijuwile kinhu kimpula. Vino modaha kuking'wela kikasi cha madununzo chonda niking'wele niye? Na kubatizigwa ubatizo unibatizigwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Todaha,”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawalongela, “Mong'wela kikasi chonda ning'wele niye na kubatizigwa ubatizo wonda nibatizigwe niye. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lakini niye nabule udahi wa kusagula nani yakale mwambu wa mkono wangu wa kudila hebu wa kumoso. Mulungu ayo yonda yawagwee hanhu aho, wanhu waja yawasagule.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Baho wanahina longo viwahulike vivo wawagevuzikila ng'hani Yakobo na Yohana. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu kawakema wose hamoja kawalongela, “Mojuwa kamba waja wokoneka wakulu wa isi, wowalanguliza wanhu kwa nguvu, na wakulu wao wana udahi. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lakini haili vivo kumwenu. Munhu yoyose yolonda kuwa munhu mkulu, yawe msang'hanaji wa wose. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Na munhu yoyose yolonda kuwa wa ichanduso, yawe mtumwa wa wose. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kwavija Mwana wa Munhu hezile kusang'hanilwa, lakini keza kuwasang'hanila wanhu na kuulava ugima wake kwa kuwakombola wanhu wengi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya msuwameso</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 20:29-34; Luk 18:35-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Wavika Yeliko. Yesu na wanahina zake hamoja na lunhu lwa wanhu viwakalile wosegela, msuwameso imoja yakalile yopula, twaga jake Batumayo, mwanage Timayo kakala mnzila. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Batumayo viyahulike Yesu wa Nazaleti kobita, kasonga kukemelela, “Yesu, mwanage Daudi nyonele bazi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Wanhu wengi wamkomhokela, wamulongela yanyamale, lakini heyo kagendelela kukemelela ng'hani, “Mwana wa Daudi, nyonele bazi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu kema, kalonga, “Mkemeni.”</para>
  <para style="p">Avo wamkema, wamulongela, “Gangamala! Ima, kokukema.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kawasa mgolole wake, kazumha kamcholela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu kamuuza, “Kolonda nikutendele choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">Munhu ayo kamwidika, “Mfundiza, nolonda kulola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Chola, kutamanila kwako kukuhonya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Bahaja kadaha kulola kamkweleleza Yesu mnzila.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokwingila Yelusalemu kwa ng'henze</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 21:1-11; Luk 19:28-40; Yoh 12:12-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Viwavikile behi na Yelusalemu, habehi na mabuga ga Betifage na Betania kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni, Yesu kawatuma wanahina zake wabili wamulongolele. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Gendeni kuna ikijiji kili kuulongozi wenu, mwahengila momvika mwana mhunda kafungigwa, nayo yang'hali hanakweligwa na munhu. Mfunguleni mumgale hano. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Munhu yoyose yahawauza habali motenda avo, mulongeleni Mndewa komulonda, nayo kombweza sambi baha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wanahina waja wachola wamvika mwana mhunda kafungigwa hana ulwivi lwa ng'anda uilola na nzila. Viwakalile womfungula, <verse number="5" style="v"/>wanhu wemile aho wawauza, “Motenda choni, habali momfungula imhunda?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wawedika kamba Yesu viyawalongele, wanhu waja wawaleka wachole. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wamgala imwana mhunda ayo kwa Yesu, watandika viwalo vao mumgongo wa imhunda, Yesu kakwela uchanha. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wanhu wengi wanzanza viwalo vao mnzila, na wayagwe wabena mibunho wayanzanza mnzila. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wanhu wakalile kukisogo na kuulongozi wa Yesu wakemelela, “Mulungu yatogolwe! Mndewa Mulungu yamtambikile ayo yokwiza kwa twaga jake! <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mulungu yautambikile undewa ukwiza wa mndewa Daudi, muhenga wetu! Mulungu yeli uchanha ng'hani yatogolwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kavika Yelusalemu, kachola kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu, kawegesela kuno na kuno. Lakini kwavija zuwa dikala dihongile, Yesu kachola Betania na wanahina zake longo na wabili.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kouduila mbiki wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 21:18-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Imitondo yake, viwakalile wosegela Betania, Yesu kakala na nzala. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kwa kutali Yesu kawona mbiki wa mtini ukalile na mijani mingi, avo kaucholela yalole kamba kodaha kupata tunda jojose lakini viyavikile honile tunda jojose, ila majani gaiyeka, kwavija haukalile msimu wa kulela. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kaulongela mbiki wa mtini, “Munhu sekeyaje tunda jojose kumwako kabili!”</para>
  <para style="p">Wanahina zake wamuhulika viyalongile vivo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kochola kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 21:12-17; Luk 19:45-48; Yoh 2:13-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Viwavikile Yelusalemu, Yesu kachola kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu. Kasonga kuwawinga wanhu wose wakalile wogula na kuchuuza vinhu. Kazibidula meza za wanhu wakalile wovunja sente na vigoda va wanhu wakalile wochuuza njiwa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kawagomesa sekewasole kinhu chochose kubitila kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Abaho kawafundiza, “Yandikigwa mna Gamaandiko Gang'alile, ‘Ng'anda yangu yokuwa kae ya kupulila kwa wanhu wa isi zose.’ Lakini mweye moitenda mhango ya wabavi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa viwahulike vivo, wasonga kuzahila nzila ya kumkoma Yesu, lakini wamdumba, kwavija lunhu lwa wanhu lukanganya mafundizo gake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Viivikile ichungulo, Yesu na wanahina zake wasegela kudibuga.</para>
  <para style="s">Fundizo da mbiki wa mtini unyalile</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 21:20-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Imitootondo yake, viwakalile wobita mnzila wawona mbiki awo wa mtini unyala gogodaa! <verse number="21" style="v"/>Petulo kakumbuka kija kilawilile, kamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, lola, umbiki wa mtini uuduile unyala!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mumtogole Mulungu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nowalongela ukweli, munhu yoyose yahakilongela kigongo kino, Ng'oka ukayase mbahali na hakona shaka muumoyo wake lakini kotogola kiyolonga cholawilila, na Mulungu komtendela. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Avo nowalongeleni, mwahampula Mulungu kinhu chochose, togoleni kamba mubokela, mogweleligwa chochose chonda mupule. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mwahampula Mulungu geleni kumgongo nzambi ziwawatendele wanhu, muladi Tataenu yeli kuulanga nayo yazigele kumgongo nzambi zenu zimutendile. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kamba hamuzigela kumgongo nzambi za wanhu ziwawatendele, na Tataenu yeli kuulanga honda yazigele kumgongo bule nzambi zenu zimutendile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya udahi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 21:23-27; Luk 20:1-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Wavika kabili Yelusalemu, Yesu viyakalile kogenda kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu, wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na wavele wamcholela, <verse number="28" style="v"/>wamuuza, “Vino kotenda gano gose kwa udahi gani? Nani yakugwelele udahi wa kutenda gano?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Na niye nowauza mbuli imoja, mwahanidika, baho nowalongeleni notenda gano kwa udahi gani. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nongeleni, udahi wa Yohana wa kubatiza ulawa kwa Mulungu hebu kwa wanhu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Wasonga kuilongela, “Twahalonga, ‘Ulawa kwa Mulungu,’ kotuuza, ‘Habali hamumtogole Yohana?’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lakini twahalonga, ‘Ulawa kwa wanhu,’” wawadumba wanhu, kwavija wanhu wamtogola Yohana kamba mtula ndagu wa Mulungu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Avo wamwidika, “Tweye hatujuwile.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawalongela, “Na niye siwalongela bule kwa udahi gani notenda gano.”</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa walimaji mumgunda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 21:33-46; Luk 20:9-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga nao kwa simo, “Munhu imoja kahanda mizabibu mumgunda wake. Kazungulusila lwigo mumgunda wake, kahimba hanhu ha kukamila zabibu, kazenga lingo. Abaho kawakodisha walimaji, kafunga mwanza kachola.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="04 Winepress.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="12:1">Wanhu wabili wobojoga zabibu mna ihanhu ha kukamila zabibu</figure> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Msimu wa kubawa zabibu viuvikile, kamtuma msang'hanaji kwa awo walimaji yamgalile zabibu kulawa mumgunda wake. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lakini walimaji awo wamgoga, wamtowa, wamuwinga makono gaiyeka. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Abaho kamtuma msang'hanaji iyagwe, ayo nayo wamtowa mdipala na wamgela kinyala. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mwene mgunda kamtuma msang'hanaji iyagwe, nayo wamkoma, na kawatuma wayagwe wengi wawatendela vivo, wayagwe wawatowa na wayagwe wawakoma. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kakala kasigala na munhu imoja wa kumtuma, nayo kakala mwanage yamnogele ng'hani. Kamtuma kuno kolonga, ‘Womtegeleza mwanangu.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lakini walimaji wailongela, ‘Ino ayo muhazi, lekeni tumkome tusole uhazi wake!’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Avo wamgoga, wamkoma wamwasa kunze ya umgunda wa imizabibu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kawauza, “Vino mwene mgunda kotendaze? Kokwiza kuwakoma walimaji wose na kowakodisha walimaji wayagwe mgunda awo wa mizabibu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hamgasomile Maandiko Gang'alile vigalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Dibwe wadilemile wazengaji,</para>
  <para style="q">Sambi digalamuka dibwe kulu kubanza gose.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mbuli ino itendigwa na Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q">nayo yotukanganya!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Walangulizi wa Wayahudi walonda kumgoga Yesu, kwavija wajuwa lusimo luno kawalonga wao. Lakini waludumba lunhu lwa wanhu, avo wamuleka wasegela.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kulipa kodi</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 22:15-22; Luk 20:20-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe na wanhu wa Helode wakala watumigwe kwa Yesu, wamgoge kwa mbuli zake. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wamcholela wamulongela, “Mfundiza, tokujuwa gweye kwa munhu ulonga ukweli, humdumba munhu yoyose, hutonga ukulu wa munhu. Lakini gweye kofundiza goyolonda Mulungu wanhu wagatende. Tulongele, vino vinoga kulipa kodi kwa Mndewa wa Lumi hebu havinogile bule? Tulipe hebu seketulipe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kaujuwa ubala wao kawauza, “Habali monigeza? Ngalileni isente niilole.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wamgalila isente, nayo kawauza, “Vino kihanga kino cha nani? Na twaga dino da nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Va Mndewa wa Lumi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mgweleleni Mndewa wa Lumi vili va Mndewa wa Lumi, na mgweleleni Mulungu vili va Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nao wamkanganya Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kuzilibuka</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 22:23-33; Luk 20:27-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Abaho Masadukayo, wanhu wolonga kuduhu kuzilibuka kulawa kwa wafile. Wayagwe wamcholela Yesu wamulongela, <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Mfundiza, Musa katwandikila, ‘Munhu yahafa na kuleka mwehe wake bila wana, ndugu yake munhu ayo kolondeka yamsole mgane ayo, yamulelele ndugu yake yafile wana.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kukala na ndugu saba, ija imkulu kasola mwehe kafa halekile wana. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wakabili nayo kamuhala mgane ayo nayo vivija kafa halekile wana. Vivija kwa wakadatu kafa halekile wana. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Abaho kwa wayagwe, wose saba wamsolile mgane ayo wafa hawalekile wana. Ako kumwande, mtwanzi ayo nayo kafa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Avo, wanhu wose wafile wahazilibuka mwiisiku ya kuzilibuka, mtwanzi ayo kokuwa mwehe wa nani? Kwavija wose saba wakala wamsolile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mweye mopotela! Kwavija hamugajuwile Maandiko Gang'alile hebu udahi wa Mulungu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwavija wanhu wafile vonda wazilibuke, hawasola wala hawasoligwa wokuwa kamba wasenga wa kuulanga. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kwa mbuli ya kuzilibuka kwa wanhu wafile, hamusomile mna ikitabu cha Musa mbuli ya kisolo kikwaka? Mulungu kamulongela Musa, ‘Niye na Mulungu wa Abulahamu na wa Isaka na wa Yakobo.’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Heyo heli Mulungu wa wanhu wafile, ila Mulungu wa wanhu wagima. Avo mweye mopotela ng'hani!”</para>
  <para style="s">Lagizo kulu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 22:34-40; Luk 10:25-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mfundiza Malagizo ga Musa imoja yakalile aho kahulika viwaibamilile. Kona kamba Yesu kawedika goya Masadukayo, avo kamkwesela Yesu kamuuza, “Mna ga Malagizo gose lagizo gani dili kulu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Lagizo dili kulu ijo dino, ‘Tegelezeni mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli! Mndewa Mulungu wetu ayo Mndewa yaiyeka. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mnogele Mndewa Mulungu wako kwa moyo wako wose, kwa loho yako yose, kwa nzewele zako zose, na kwa nguvu zako zose.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lagizo da kabili kwa ukulu ijo dino, ‘Mnogele miyago kamba viuinogela mwenyego.’ Kuduhu lagizo diyagwe kulu kubanza gano mabili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mfundiza Malagizo ga Musa kamtogola Yesu, “Mfundiza, kwidika goya viulongile, Mndewa ayo Mulungu na kuduhu iyagwe ila heyo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kumnogela Mulungu wako kwa moyo wako wose na kwa nzewele zako zose na kwa nguvu zako, na kumnogela miyago kamba viuinogela mwenyego, kunoga ng'hani kugoga Malagizo gano mabili kubanza kumulavila Mulungu nhosa za wanyama na nhosa ziyagwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu viyonile munhu ayo kedika goya, kamulongela, “Huli kutali na Undewa wa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Kusongela aho haduhu munhu yoyose yagezile kumuuza Yesu mbuli yoyose.</para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito Mkombola ayo nani</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 22:41-46; Luk 20:41-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile kofundiza Mng'anda ya Mulungu, kawauza, “Habali wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wolonga Kilisito Mkombola mwana wa Daudi? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Loho Yang'alile kamulongoza Daudi kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q">Kala hano hana mwambu wa mkono wangu wa kudila</para>
  <para style="q">mbaka niweke hasi mmagulu gako wanhu wakwihile.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Avo Daudi mwenyego kamkema, ‘Mndewa.’ Avo Kilisito Mkombola kodahaze kuwa mwana wa Daudi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowazuma wanhu mbuli ya wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 23:1-36; Luk 20:45-47</para>
  <para style="p">Lunhu lwa wanhu lukala lumtegeleza Yesu kwa kudeng'helela. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Viyakalile kofundiza, kawalongela, “Muiteganye na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, wonogelwa kugenda kuno wovala mikanzu mitali na kulamusigwa na wanhu mna gamagulilo, <verse number="39" style="v"/>wosagula vigoda va haulongozi mzing'anda za kumpula Mulungu na kukala hanhu hanogile mna izinyimwili nyimwili. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Wowaboka wagane vinhu na kusola ng'anda zao, abaho woilagusa wanoga kwa kumpula Mulungu mbuli nyingi. Nhaguso yao yokuwa ng'hulu!”</para>
  <para style="s">Sadaka ya mgane</para>
  <para style="r">Luk 21:1-4</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kakala behi na kigelo cha kulavila sadaka hana Ing'anda ya Mulungu, kawalola wanhu viwolava sente mkigelo. Matajili wengi walava sente nyingi. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Abaho keza mgane mkiwa kalava sente mbili ndodo. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu kawakema wanahina zake kawalongela, “Nowalongela ukweli mgane mkiwa ino kalava sente nyingi mna ikigelo cha sadaka kubanza wose wayagwe. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kwavija wose walava vija visigale muutajili wao, lakini mgane ino hamoja na ukiwa wake kalava vose viyelinavo.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli ya kubanangika kwa Ng'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 24:1-2; Luk 21:5-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile kosegela kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu, mwanahina wake imoja kamulongela, “Mfundiza, lola mabwe gano na ng'anda zino vizinogile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Kozona ng'anda zino vizili ng'hulu? Haduhu dibwe donda dilekigwe uchanha ya diyagwe, kila dibwe dokwasigwa hasi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kugaya na kudununzika</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 24:3-14; Luk 21:7-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni, mwambu kwa mwambu na Ng'anda ya Mulungu, baho Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana na Andeleya wamcholela Yesu kinyelegezi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wamulongela, “Tulongele, choni chonda kitendeke kulagusa kipindi cha kulawilila gano gose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Muiteganye, munhu yoyose sekeyawavizile. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wanhu wengi, wokwiza kwa twaga jangu na kulonga, ‘Nene iyo heyo!’ Nao wowavizila wanhu wengi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwahahulika mbuli za ng'hondo kutali na mbuli za ng'hondo mmabehi, sekemudumbe, kwavija gano gose golondigwa galawilile, ila kimambukizo king'hali hakinavika. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Isi yoitowa na isi iyagwe, undewa woitowa na undewa uyagwe. Kila hanhu hokuwa na mitigisiko mikulu ya isi na lufilili lwa nzala. Gano gose kamba mwanduso wa usungu wa kulela mwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Na mweye muiteganye. Mogogigwa na kugaligwa mkitala. Motoigwa mna izing'anda za kumpula Mulungu, mogaligwa haulongozi wa wakulu wa isi na wandewa mbuli ya niye, muladi muwalongele Mbuli Inogile. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lakini kimambukizo king'hali hakinavika, Mbuli Inogile tanhu yolondeka ipetigwe kwa wanhu wose. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mwahagogigwa na kugaligwa mkitala, sekemunyawenyawe mbuli ya kulonga. Kipindi chahavika longeni chochose chonda mugweleligwe. Kwavija mbuli zonda mulonge hazili zenu, ila zolawa kwa Loho Yang'alile. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Munhu komuhinduka ndugu yake too yakomigwe, na tata komuhinduka mwanage yakomigwe. Wana wowahinduka tata zao na mama zao wakomigwe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wowehila mweye mbuli ya niye, lakini yoyose yonda yafunge umoyo mbaka kukimambukizo kokomboligwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Magayo makulu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 24:15-28; Luk 21:20-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Vondamuchone, ‘Kinhu kinyolodoke kigala Ubananzi’ kima hanhu si hake. Munhu yosoma yavijuwe, waja weli mwiisi ya Yudea wakimbilile kuna ivigongo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Munhu yeli mkiswili cha ng'anda yake sekeyahumuluke hasi mna ing'anda yake kusola kinhu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yeli kumgunda sekeyabwele ukae kusola kiwalo chake. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wogaya watwanzi wali na zinda na waja wokong'heza mna izisiku azo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mpuleni Mulungu mbuli zino sekezilawilile mna ikipindi cha kihuhwe! <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwavija siku azo hokuwa na magayo makulu, haganalawila kulawa kuna ichanduso Mulungu viyaumbile isi mbaka sambi na honda galawilile kabili. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini Mulungu kazihunguza siku zizo, maza hazihunguze sambi yahone munhu yoyose. Lakini mbuli ya wanhu zake yawasagule, Mulungu kazihunguza siku zizo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Avo, munhu yoyose yahawalongela, ‘Amweye, Kilisito kahano!’ hebu ‘Kahaja!’ sekemumtogolele. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwavija wolawilila makilisito na watula ndagu wa uvizi. Wotenda unzonza na vilaguso muladi yahadahika wawavizile hata waja wasaguligwe na Mulungu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Muiteganye! Niye niwalongela kila kinhu kipindi king'hali hakinavika.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Mwana wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 24:29-31; Luk 21:25-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Gahamala magayo ga siku azo, zuwa dokuwa ziza, na mwezi honda umwemwese bule, <verse number="25" style="v"/>nhondo zolagala kulawa kuulanga, na vinhu vili kuulanga votigisika. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Abaho Mwana wa Munhu kolawilila, kokwiza mna gamawingu kwa nguvu ng'hulu na ukulu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Abaho kowatuma wasenga zake wa kuulanga mna izibanzi nne za mwiisi, waweke hamoja wanhu wasaguligwe na Mulungu kulawa mwambu uno wa isi na uyagwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Fundizo da mbiki wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 24:32-35; Luk 21:29-33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Ifunzeni kubitila mbiki wa mtini. Matambi gake gahasonga kuzuka na kwika majani, mujuwe kamba vuli da mmabehi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vivija, mwahazona mbuli azo, mojuwa kamba kammabehi kwiza. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli, wanhu wa lukolo luno hawafa wose mbaka gano gose galawilile. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ulanga na isi vobita, lakini mbuli zangu hondazibite ng'o.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuduhu munhu yaijuwile siku hebu saa</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 24:36-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Kuduhu yaijuwile siku hebu saa ya kwiza, siyo wasenga wa kuulanga wala Mwana, lakini Tata yaiyeka ayo yaijuwile. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Muiteganye, na mukale meso, kwavija Hamkijuwile kipindi chonda yeze. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yokuwa kamba munhu yofunga mwanza na kuwaleka wasang'hanaji zake walolese goya vinhu, kila munhu kamgwaa sang'hano yakutenda. Kamulagiza mkalizi wa mulango yakale meso. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Muiteganye, kwavija hamujuwile kipindi cha kwiza mkulu wa ng'anda, yodaha kuwa ichungulo, kilo kikulu, nzogolo zikwika, hebu imitondo. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yaheza kwa kuwasinhusa, sekeyawavike muwasile. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mbuli iniwalongele mweye, nowalongela wanhu wose, kaleni meso!”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kiseto cha kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:1-5; Luk 22:1-2; Yoh 11:45-53</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Zikala zisigale siku mbili ivike Nyimwili nyimwili ya Pasaka na Magate haganageligwa usasu. Wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wakala wozahila nzila ya kumgoga Yesu wamkome. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Walonga, “Seketutende avo kipindi cha Nyimwili nyimwili ya Pasaka, buleavo wanhu woding'huka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobakigwa mavuta ako Betania</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:6-13; Yoh 12:1-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kakala Betania mng'anda ya Simoni, munhu yakalile na utamu wa dikulu. Viyakalile koja, mtwanzi imoja keza na nyhupa ya alabasita imemile mavuta gonung'hila goya ga bei ng'hulu. Kaifungula, kamgidila Yesu ga mavuta mdipala. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe wakalile aho wagevuzika, wailongela, “Unanzi gani uno wa mavuta!” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Abaho wamkomhokela mtwanzi ayo, walonga, “Mavuta gano gahauzigwe kwa sente magana madatu na zisente wagweleligwe wakiwa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kawalongela, “Mulekeni, habali momgaza mtwanzi ino? Niye kanhendela mbuli inogile. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wanhu wakiwa mokala nao siku zose, saa yoyose mwahalonda modaha kuwataza. Lakini honda mukale na niye siku zose. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mtwanzi ino katenda viyadahile, kalongola kulubakaza lukuli lwangu mavuta ganogile, kulutanda kwa kuzikigwa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli, kokose konda ipetigwe Mbuli Inogile mwiisi, kino kiyatendile mtwanzi ino cholongigwa, avo wanhu womkumbuka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kotogola kumuhinduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:14-16; Luk 22:3-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Abaho imoja wa wanahina zake longo na wabili yakemigwe Yuda Isikaliote, kachola kwa wakulu wa walava nhosa yamuhinduke Yesu kumwao. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Avo viwahulike kiyalongile wadeng'helela, na wailagana nayo kumgwaa sente. Avo Yuda kasonga kuzahila nzila ya kumgela Yesu mmakono gao.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koja lujo lwa Pasaka na wanahina zake</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:17-25; Luk 22:7-14, 21-23; Yoh 13:21-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mna isiku ya ichanduso ya Nyimwili nyimwili ya Magate hagageligwe Usasu, siku dijo mwana ng'hondolo wa Pasaka kochinjigwa, wanahina zake Yesu wamuuza, “Kolonda tuchole kwahi tukutandile lujo lwa Pasaka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kawatuma wanahina zake wabili kawalongela, “Gendeni kudibuga, momting'hana mbigalo kaidikwa nongo ya mazi. Mkwelelezeni, <verse number="14" style="v"/>mbaka mng'anda yonda yengile, mulongeleni mwene kae, ‘Mfundiza kolonga, da kwahi gati da kudila lujo lwa Pasaka niye na wanahina zangu?’ <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nayo kowalagusila gati kulu dili uchanha dikigwa goya na dihambigwa. Mumo tutandileni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wanahina zake wasegela, wachola kudibuga, wavika kila kinhu vivija viyawalongele Yesu, avo wamtandila lujo lwa Pasaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Viivikile ichungulo, Yesu kavika na wanahina zake longo na wabili. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Viwakalile woja, Yesu kalonga, “Nowalongeleni imoja wenu yoja na niye, konihinduka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wanahina zake wanyawanyawa, wamuuza, imoja imoja, “Vino gweye kolonga niye?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Imoja wenu mweye longo na wabili, yozanhika gate jake hamoja na niye mbakuli. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwana wa Munhu kofa kamba Maandiko Gang'alile vigolonga. Lakini kogaya munhu ija yomuhinduka Mwana wa Munhu. Yahanogile ng'hani kamba munhu ayo sambi yavumbuke!”</para>
  <para style="s">Lujo lwa Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:26-30; Luk 22:14-20; 1Kol 11:23-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Viwakalile woja, Yesu kasola gate, kamgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu, kadibanzula na kawagwaa wanahina zake kalonga, “Soleni, uno ulo lukuli lwangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Abaho kasola kikasi cha divai, kamgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu, kawagwaa wanahina zake, wose waking'wela. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Ino ayo damu yangu ilagusa lagano da Mulungu, ikwitika mbuli ya wanhu wengi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nowalongela, kusongela sambi honda ning'we kabili divai, mbaka siku dijo donda ning'we divai ya sambi Muundewa wa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Abaho wemba lwila, wachola kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolagula Petulo kombela</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:31-35; Luk 22:31-34; Yoh 13:36-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye mose mokimbila na kundeka niiyeka, kwavija Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, ‘Mulungu komtowa msusilaji, na ng'hondolo wose wopwililika.’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lakini nahazilibuka, nowalongolela kuchola Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Petulo kamwidika Yesu, “Hata kamba wose wahakuleka, niye sikuleka bule!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela Petulo, “Nokulongela ukweli, kilo cha lelo nzogolo yang'hali hana kwika miyanza mibili, konibela miyanza midatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Petulo kagangamiza kulonga, “Silonga vivo bule, hata kamba nahafa na gweye!”</para>
  <para style="p">Na wanahina wayagwe walonga vivo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kompula Mulungu ako Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:36-46; Luk 22:39-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wavika hanhu hokemigwa Getisemane, Yesu kawalongela, “Kaleni hano, niye nogenda kumpula Mulungu.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kawasola Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana. Yesu kona usungu na kanyunyuwala. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kawalongela wanahina zake, “Usungu uli muumoyo wangu mkulu ng'hani wodaha kung'homa. Kaleni hano meso.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kachola kumwande kidogo, kaibwanha hasi, kampula Mulungu, kamba yahadahika sekeyaibitile saa ayo ya madununzo. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kampula Mulungu, “Tata! Kumwako gose godahika. Ukisegeze kikasi kino cha madununzo. Lakini siyo kamba vinilonda niye ila viulonda gweye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Abaho kabwela kawavika wanahina zake wadatu wawasa. Kamulongela Petulo, “Simoni kuwasa? Vino hamudahile kukala meso hata saa dimoja?” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Kaleni meso, mumpule Mulungu sekemwingile mna ukugezigwa. Moyo wa munhu wolonda kutenda ganogile, lakini lukuli lwaduhu nguvu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kachola lwa kabili kumpula Mulungu, kalonga mbuli zizija. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Viyabwelile kabili, kawavika wanahina zake wawasa, kwavija meso gao gakala na utulo. Hawaijuwile mbuli yakumulongela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Viyabwelile mwanza wa kadatu, kawalongela, “Mung'hali muwasa na kubwihila? Yotosha! Kipindi kivika! Loleni, Mwana wa Munhu kogeligwa mmakono ga wanhu wene nzambi. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Lamukeni, tuchole. Loleni munhu yonihinduka kavika!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogogigwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:47-56; Luk 22:47-53; Yoh 18:3-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile yang'hali yogendelela kulonga, imoja wa wanahina zake longo na wabili, yakemigwe Yuda Isikaliote kavika. Keza na lunhu lutumigwe na wakulu wa walava nhosa, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na wavele, kuno wapapa mapanga na malungu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yuda Isikaliote yomuhinduka Yesu kawagwaa kilaguso, kawalongela, “Munhu yonda nimnonele ayo yummulonda. Mgogeni mumgele mmakono genu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Bahaja Yuda kamcholela Yesu kamulongela, “Mfundiza!” Abaho kamnonela. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Avo wamgoga Yesu wamgodeka. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Lakini imoja wa waja wakalile na Yesu, kasomola panga jake, kamkanha digwiti msang'hanaji wa Mkulu wa walava nhosa. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Vino habali mwizile kungoga na mapanga na malungu kamba vija nambavi? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Kila siku ng'hala na mweye, nowafundiza kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu, hamnigogile. Lakini gano gatendeka muladi Maandiko Gang'alile galawilile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Abaho wanahina wose wamuleka wakimbila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Mbwanga imoja yavalile mgolole wiiyeka, kakala yomkweleleza Yesu. Walonda kumgoga, <verse number="52" style="v"/>lakini kauleka mgolole wake, kakimbila mwazi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamkitala</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:57-68; Luk 22:54-55, 63-71; Yoh 18:13-14, 19-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kagaligwa mng'anda ya Mkulu wa walava nhosa, mumo wakulu wa walava nhosa wose, wavele na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa waiting'hana. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Petulo kamkweleleza Yesu kwa kutali, kengila muuluwa lwa mkulu wa walava nhosa, kakala hasi na wakalizi, kokotela moto. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa na wanhu wose wa mkitala wazahila usindila wa uvizi muladi wamkome Yesu, lakini hawaupatile bule. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Wanhu wengi walonga mbuli za uvizi kwa Yesu, lakini usindila wao hauwilumbile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Abaho wanhu wayagwe wema walonga mbuli za uvizi kwa Yesu. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Walonga, “Tumuhulika kolonga, ‘Noibomola Ng'anda ino ya Mulungu izengigwe na wanhu, na kwa siku ndatu noizenga iyagwe haizengigwe na wanhu.’ ” <verse number="59" style="v"/>Na awo vivija usindila wao hauwilumbile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Mkulu wa walava nhosa kenuka mgameso ga wanhu kamuuza Yesu, “Vino kuduhu mbuli ya kwidika kwa kitala choolava wanhu wano?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kanyamala tuluu, halongile mbuli, Mkulu wa walava nhosa kamuuza kabili, “Gweye ayo Kilisito Mkombola, Mwana wa ija Yotogoligwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Nene iyo heyo. Mweye momona Mwana wa Munhu kakala muukulu mwambu wa mkono wa kudila wa Mulungu yeli na Udahi, kokwiza mna gamawingu ga kuulanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Mkulu wa walava nhosa kakidega kiwalo chake, kalonga, “Hatulonda usindila uyagwe! <verse number="64" style="v"/>Muhulika viyomuliga Mulungu. Mweye mogesaze?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wose walonga, kabananga kolondeka yakomigwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe wamtemela mate Yesu, wamgubika gameso, wamtowa na wamulongela, “Lagula, nani yakutowile!” Abaho wakalizi wamsola wamtowa ng'hofi.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:69-75; Luk 22:56-62; Yoh 18:15-18, 25-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Petulo viyakalile yang'hali hasi muuluwa, msang'hanaji imoja wa kitwanzi wa mkulu wa walava nhosa kamcholela. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Viyamone Petulo kokotela moto, kamulola bunhuu kamulongela, “Gweye vivija kukala hamoja na Yesu wa Nazaleti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Petulo kabela, “Bule, sijuwile kiulonga.” Abaho Petulo kalawa kunze mbaka kuna uluhelengo. Bahaja nzogolo keka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Msang'hanaji ija wa kitwanzi kamona Petulo, kawalongela wanhu wemile aho, “Ino nayo imoja wao!” <verse number="70" style="v"/>Lakini Petulo kabela kabili.</para>
  <para style="p">Hamwande kidogo wanhu wakalile wemile aho wamulongela Petulo kabili, “Gweye vivija kwa imoja wao, kwavija kwa mwenekae wa Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Petulo kalonga, “Mulungu kojuwa nolonga ukweli, niduiligwe nahalonga uvizi, simjuwile munhu yumulonga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Bahaja nzogolo keka mwanza wa kabili, baho Petulo kakumbuka mbuli ziyalongeligwe na Yesu, “Nzogolo yang'hali hanakwika miyanza mibili, konibela miyanza midatu.” Avo Petulo kasonga kulila.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 27:1-2, 11-14; Luk 23:1-5; Yoh 18:28-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Imitootondo, wakulu wa walava nhosa, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, wavele na wanhu wose wa mkitala waiting'hana, waitogolela kumgala Yesu kwa Pilato. Wamgodeka nzabi, wamgala kwa Pilato. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pilato kamuuza Yesu, “Gweye ayo Mndewa wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamwidika, “Ona, vivo viulonga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa wamulavila Yesu vitala vingi, <verse number="4" style="v"/>avo Pilato kamuuza Yesu kabili, “Hulonda kwidika? Tegeleza viwokulavila vitala!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu hedike mbuli yoyose, Pilato kakanganya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotagusigwa yafe</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 27:15-26; Luk 23:13-25; Yoh 18:39-19:16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yahavikaga Nyimwili nyimwili ya Pasaka Pilato kamfungulilaga mfungwa imoja wamulondile wanhu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mna ikipindi acho kukala na munhu imoja twaga jake Balaba, kakala yagodekigwe mkifungo na wayage, mbuli ya ukomaji kipindi wanhu viwading'huke. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu viluiting'hane, lumpula Pilato yawatendele kamba viyatendaga. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pilato kawauza, “Molonda niwafungulileni mndewa wa Wayahudi?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pilato kajuwa goya kamba wakulu wa walava nhosa wamgela Yesu mmakono gake kwavija wamonela migongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lakini wakulu wa walava nhosa wawading'hula wanhu wampule Pilato yawafungulile Balaba. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pilato kaluuza kabili lunhu luja, “Vino molonda nhende choni kwa munhu ino yumumkema mndewa wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wakemelela, “Muwambe mumsalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pilato kawauza, “Vino kabananga choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">Awo wagendelela kukemelela, “Muwambe mumsalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pilato kalonda kulunogeza lunhu lwa wanhu, avo kamfungulila Balaba mkifungo. Abaho kalagiza Yesu yatoigwe mbalati na yawambigwe mumsalaba.</para>
  <para style="s">Wakalizi womzeha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 27:27-31; Yoh 19:2-3</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wakalizi wamgala Yesu muuluwa lwa ng'anda ya mkulu wa isi, waiting'hana na wayao wose. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wamvaza kiwalo cha Undewa, waluka ngata ya miba, waika mdipala jake. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wamulamusa, “Mwinyi, Mndewa wa Wayahudi!” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wamtowa mbalati mdipala wamtemela mate, wamfugamila na kumwinamila. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Viwamambukize kumzeha, wamvula ikiwalo cha Undewa wamvaza viwalo vake. Abaho wamulava kunze wamuwambe mumsalaba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowambigwa mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 27:32-44; Luk 23:26-43; Yoh 19:17-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Viwakalile mnzila wamting'hana munhu imoja twaga jake Simoni, mwenekae wa Kilene, tatao Alekizanda na Lufo. Kipindi acho kakala kolawa kumgunda, wakalizi wamnanahiza yaupape msalaba wa Yesu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wamgala Yesu mbaka hanhu hokemigwa Goligota, fambulo jake, “Hanhu ha Fumvu da Pala.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wamgwaa Yesu divai ihanganyigwe na kinhu kili usungu, lakini Yesu kalema kung'wa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Abaho wamuwamba Yesu mumsalaba, waigolela viwalo vake, kwa kubwanha simbi, ili yajuwike simbi yomgwila nani avo yasole ikiwalo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ikala saa ndatu imitondo viwamuwambile Yesu mumsalaba. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wandika kilamuso cha kutagusigwa kwake, chandikigwa vino, “Mndewa wa Wayahudi.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Vivija wawawamba wabavi wabili hamoja na Yesu, imoja mwambu wake wa mkono wa kudila na iyagwe mwambu wake wa kumoso. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Avo galawilila Maandiko Gang'alile galongile, “Kekigwa hamoja na wanhu watendile gehile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wabita nzila watigisa mapala gao wamuliga Yesu, walonga, “Gweye kulonga koibomola Ng'anda ya Mulungu na kuizenga kabili kwa siku ndatu! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lelo humuluka mumsalaba uikombole mwenyego!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Vivija wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wamzeha Yesu walonga, “Kawakombola wayagwe, lakini hadaha kuikombola mwenyego! <verse number="32" style="v"/>Leka tumulole Kilisito Mkombola, Mndewa wa Izilaeli, lelo yahahumuluka mumsalaba na tweye tomtogola!”</para>
  <para style="p">Vivija na wanhu waja wabili wawambigwe hamoja na Yesu wamuliga.</para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 27:45-56; Luk 23:44-49; Yoh 19:28-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Viivikile saa sita imisi, isi yose ikala igubikigwe na ziza totolo, ziza dijo dikala kwa masaa madatu. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Viivikile saa tisa imisi, Yesu kalila kwa sauti ng'hulu, “Eloi, Eloi, lama, sabakitani?” Fambulo jake, “Mulungu wangu, Mulungu wangu, habali kundeka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe wemile aho viwamuhulike, walonga, “Tegelezeni, komkema Eliya!” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Munhu imoja kakimbila kavabika dodoki mwiidivai, kadinanika mulubiki, kadika mmulomo wa Yesu, kalonga, “Beta tulole kamba Eliya kokwiza kumuhumulusa mumsalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu kalila kwa sauti ng'hulu, abaho kafa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Panziya da Ng'anda ya Mulungu digola gati da Ng'anda ya Mulungu na hanhu hong'ala ng'hani, didegeka mhande mbili, kulawa uchanha mbaka hasi. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mkulu wa wakalizi yemile haulongozi ha msalaba kamona Yesu viyafile, kalonga, “Kweli munhu ino kakala Mwana wa Mulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Baho kukala na watwanzi wayagwe wakalile wolola kwa kutali. Mna iwao kakala Malia Magidalena, Malia mamao Yakobo mdodo na Yusufu na Salome. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Watwanzi awo wamkweleleza Yesu viyakalile Galilaya na kumsang'hanila. Watwanzi wayagwe wezile nayo Yelusalemu vivija wakala aho.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuzikigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 27:57-61; Luk 23:50-56; Yoh 19:38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Viivikile ichungulo ing'hali hainavika siku ya Kubwihila. Wayahudi wakala woitanda kwa siku ayo ya Kubwihila. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yusufu mwenekae wa Alimataya, imoja wa wakulu wa Mkitala cha Wayahudi yategelezigwe ng'hani kavika. Munhu ino kakala kobetela kwiza kwa Undewa wa Mulungu. Avo kamgendela Pilato bila kudumba, kampula yamgwee lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pilato kakanganya kuhulika Yesu kafa. Kamkema mkulu wa wakalizi kamuuza kamba Yesu kakala yafile mwaka. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Pilato viyalongeligwe avo na mkulu wa wakalizi kamba Yesu kafa, kamulongela Yusufu yalusole lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yusufu kagula sitili, kaluhumulusa lukuli lwa Yesu, kaluzingiliza sitili kalwika mdipanga disongoligwe mdibwe. Abaho kabimbilisa dibwe kulu kadigubika mmulomo wa dipanga. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Malia Magidalena na Malia mamake Yusufu wahona hanhu halwikigwe lukuli lwa Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kozilibuka</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 28:1-8; Luk 24:1-12; Yoh 20:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Viimalile siku ya Kubwihila, Malia Magidalena, Malia mamake Yakobo na Salome wagula mavuta gonung'hila goya wachola kulubakaza lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Imitootondo ng'hani mna isiku ya jumapili, zuwa vidisongile kulawa wachola kudipanga. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Viwakalile mnzila wailongela, “Nani yonda yatubimbilisile idibwe hamgwazo wa umulomo wa dipanga?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lakini viwalolile wona dibwe dija dibimbilisigwa mwaka hamgwazo. Dikala dibwe kulu ng'hani. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Avo wengila mdipanga, wamona mbwanga imoja yavalile kiwalo kizelu, kakala mkono wa kudila, wadumba ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Sekemudumbe nojuwa momzahila Yesu wa Nazaleti yawambigwe mumsalaba. Kahaduhu hano, kazilibuka! Loleni hanhu hawamwikile. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Avo choleni mkawalongele wanahina zake na Petulo, ‘Yesu kowalongolela Galilaya, kuko momona kamba viyawalongele.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Avo walawa mdipanga, kuno wogwaya na kudumba, wakimbila. Hawamulongele munhu yoyose mbuli ino kwavija wakala wodumba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komulawilila Malia Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 28:9-10; Yoh 20:11-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu viyazilibuke mwiisiku ya Jumapili imitootondo, tanhu kamulawilila Malia Magidalena, ija yamulavile vinyamkela saba. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nayo kachola kuwalongela waja wakalile na Yesu, wakala wang'hali woiyalala na kulila. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Viwamuhulike Malia Magidalena kolonga kamba Yesu mgima na kamona, hawamtogolele bule.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawilila wanahina wabili</para>
  <para style="r">Luk 24:13-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalawilila wanahina zake wabili mna ikihanga kiyagwe, wanahina awo wakala wochola kumgunda. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nao wabweleganya na kuwalongela wayao, lakini hawawatogolele bule.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawilila wanahina zake longo na imoja</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 28:16-20; Luk 24:36-49; Yoh 20:19-23; Sang'h 1:6-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kukimambukizo Yesu kawalawilila wanahina zake longo na imoja viwakalile woja. Kawakomhokela kwavija wakala waduhu kutamanila na wakala wadala kuwatogolela waja wamonile viyazilibuke. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Choleni mwiisi yose mukawapetele wanhu wose Mbuli Inogile. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Munhu yoyose yotogola na kubatizigwa, kokomboligwa, lakini munhu yoyose yolema kutogola kotagusigwa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wotogola wogweleligwa udahi wa kutenda unzonza, kwa twaga jangu wolava vinyamkela, wolonga ulonzi wa sambi, <verse number="18" style="v"/>wahagoga mizoka hebu wahang'wa sumu hondawatendigwe kinhu chochose kihile, wowekila wanhu watamu makono gao, nao wohona.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kuulanga</para>
  <para style="r">Luk 24:50-53; Sang'h 1:9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mndewa Yesu viyamambukize kulonga na wanahina zake, kagaligwa kuulanga, kakala muukulu mwambu wa mkono wa kudila wa Mulungu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Abaho wanahina zake wachola kila hanhu kuwapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile. Na Mndewa kasang'hana nao na unzonza wautendile ulagusa kamba usenga wao ukala wa ukweli.</para>
</usx>
